thing automotive.<br><br>Be part of a company that invests in technology that's second to none.<br><br>Bring your ambition \u00e2\u0080\u0094 we'll match it with opportunity.<br><br>This isn't just a job. It's a SMART career move.<br><br><strong>About SMART &amp; AMA Group<br><br><\/strong>SMART is part of AMA Group \u00e2\u0080\u0093 the largest collision repair network across Australia and New Zealand.<br><br>With AMA Group backing and the title of Best MSO \u00e2\u0080\u0093 Body Shop Awards 2024, your career is in safe hands.<br><br>When you join us, you're not just joining a workshop \u00e2\u0080\u0093 you're joining a network of opportunity. With national reach and diverse businesses under one roof, you'll have the freedom to grow your career, relocate, and explore new pathways wherever life takes you.<br><br><strong>Tingalpa, QLD location<br><br><\/strong>Apply now at smartcollision.com.au\/careers<br><br>SMART | AMA Group \u00e2\u0080\u0093 Together, we do it right<br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **EARNESTNESS** and tag RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ== when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ==). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Tingalpa, ","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-parts-person-ama-group-ltd-1137250","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-parts-person-ama-group-ltd-1137250"},{"slug":"remote-manager-rewards-management-coca-cola-cambodia-beverage-company-ltd-1137227","id":"1137227","epoch":1788161540,"date":"2026-08-31T07:32:20+00:00","company":"Coca-Cola Cambodia Beverage Company Ltd","company_logo":"","position":"Manager Rewards Management","tags":["exec","design","hr","infosec","customer support","payroll","finance","ops","digital nomad"],"description":"<p>We are seeking a passionate and results-driven Manager, Rewards Management to lead the delivery of compensation, benefits, HR operations, and people services that support our business strategy and employee experience. This role is responsible for managing rewards programs, HR systems, payroll governance, employee services, and process improvements while ensuring compliance with company policies and local labour regulations. The successful candidate will partner closely with business leaders and HR teams to drive operational excellence, enhance employee engagement, and deliver a high-quality people experience.<\/p><p><br><\/p><p><strong>Responsibilities<\/strong><\/p><p><br><\/p><ul><li>Manage the design and implementation of compensation, benefits, and total rewards programs aligned with company strategy.<\/li><li>Review salary structures, market benchmarking, incentive programs, and annual reward processes to maintain internal equity and market competitiveness.<\/li><li>Lead HR operations, including HRIS, payroll governance, employee records, reporting, and HR service delivery.<\/li><li>Ensure all HR policies, procedures, and employee services comply with labour law and company standards.<\/li><li>Analyze HR data and metrics to provide business insights and recommend continuous improvements.<\/li><li>Drive process improvement initiatives to enhance HR operational efficiency and employee experience.<\/li><li>Partner with business leaders and HR Business Partners on organization changes, workforce planning, and people initiatives.<\/li><li>Manage HR service vendors and benefits providers to ensure quality service delivery.<\/li><li>Lead and coach the Rewards &amp; People Services team to achieve department objectives while developing team capability.<\/li><li>Support HR transformation projects, digitization initiatives, and change management activities across the organization.<\/li><\/ul><p><br><\/p><p><strong>Qualifications<\/strong><\/p><p><br><\/p><ul><li>Bachelor's Degree in Human Resources, Business Administration, Finance, or a related discipline. Master's Degree or professional HR certification is an advantage.<\/li><li>Minimum 7 years of progressive HR experience, including at least 2\u00e2\u0080\u00933 years in Compensation &amp; Benefits, HR Operations, Payroll, or People Services.<\/li><li>Strong understanding of Total Rewards, HR Operations, HRIS, and employment legislation. Your Career Opportunity Uncapped Apply Now<\/li><li>Experience managing compensation reviews, salary benchmarking, benefits administration, and HR policies.<\/li><li>Strong analytical skills with experience using HR metrics and data to support decision-making.<\/li><li>Experience leading HR process improvements and implementing HR technology solutions.<\/li><li>Excellent stakeholder management, communication, and problem-solving skills.<\/li><li>Proven ability to manage projects, influence stakeholders, and lead a small HR team in a fast- paced environment.<\/li><\/ul><p><br><\/p><p><strong>Benefits<\/strong><\/p><p><br><\/p><p>We offer market-based competitive compensation and benefits as well as periodic reviews for merit and incentive pay based on organizational and personal achievement.<\/p><p><br><\/p><p><strong>Apply today to become our Manager, Rewards Management!<\/strong><\/p><p><br><\/p><p>Please submit your resume, cover letter, and relevant certifications to<\/p><p>hrd@coca-cola.com.kh<\/p><p>or click 'Apply Now' to submit your application directly.<\/p><p><br><\/p><p>CBC takes your privacy seriously and is committed to protecting the privacy and security of your personal information.<\/p><p><br><\/p><p><br><\/p><br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **ENHANCED** and tag RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ== when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ==). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Phnom Penh, ","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-manager-rewards-management-coca-cola-cambodia-beverage-company-ltd-1137227","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-manager-rewards-management-coca-cola-cambodia-beverage-company-ltd-1137227"},{"slug":"remote-merchandiser-jugopetrol-ad-1137234","id":"1137234","epoch":1788159002,"date":"2026-08-31T06:50:02+00:00","company":"Jugopetrol AD","company_logo":"","position":"Merchandiser","tags":["microsoft"],"description":"<p><strong>JUGOPETROL AD, <\/strong>dio HelleniQ Energy Grupe, vode\u00c4\u0087a kompanija u oblasti veleprodaje i maloprodaje nafte i naftnih derivata u Crnoj Gori pod brendom EKO, tra\u00c5\u00bei proaktivnog profesionalca na poziciji:<\/p><p><strong>Merchandiser<\/strong><\/p><p><strong>(Maloprodaja dopunskog asortimana)<\/strong><\/p><p><strong>Klju\u00c4\u008dni zadaci i odgovornosti:<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>Koordinacija implementacije i redovnog a\u00c5\u00beuriranja planograma za kategorije dopunskog asortimana;<\/li><li>Obezbje\u00c4\u0091ivanje uskla\u00c4\u0091enosti na nivou prodajnih mjesta sa cjenovnim politikama i standardima izlaganja robe;<\/li><li>Obilasci prodajnih mjesta i obuka prodajnog osoblja o standardima izlaganja proizvoda;<\/li><li>Pra\u00c4\u0087enje KPI-jeva prodaje i mer\u00c4\u008dandajzinga i predlaganje pobolj\u00c5\u00a1anja;<\/li><li>Priprema izvje\u00c5\u00a1taja o dostupnosti proizvoda i uskla\u00c4\u0091enosti sa planom rasporeda proizvoda;<\/li><li>Redovno provjeravanje adekvatnosti cjenovnika;<\/li><li>Pra\u00c4\u0087enje:<\/li><li>&nbsp;nesta\u00c5\u00a1ica proizvoda i implementacije asortimana;&nbsp;<\/li><li>&nbsp;izgleda prodajnih objekata;<\/li><li> stanja promotivnog materijala i prikazanih poruka;<\/li><li>&nbsp;rasporeda i implementacije mer\u00c4\u008dandajzinga na benzinskoj pumpi;<\/li><li>&nbsp;asortimana proizvoda u kafi\u00c4\u0087ima i stanja ponu\u00c4\u0091enih proizvoda.<\/li><\/ul><p><br><\/p><p><strong>Zahtjevi za kandidate:<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>Minimum 1 godina iskustva u maloprodajnom mer\u00c4\u008dandajzingu ili operacijama;<\/li><li>Univerzitetsko obrazovanje;<\/li><li>Aktivan voza\u00c4\u008d spreman na terenski rad;<\/li><li>Poznavanje engleskog jezika i Microsoft Office paketa;<\/li><li>Izra\u00c5\u00beena orijentisanost na detalje i sposobnost re\u00c5\u00a1avanja problema;<\/li><li>Razvijene komunikacione, organizacione i analiti\u00c4\u008dke ve\u00c5\u00a1tine.<\/li><\/ul><p><br><\/p><p>Ukoliko ispunjavate gore navedene uslove i zainteresovani ste da razvijate karijeru u dinami\u00c4\u008dnom me\u00c4\u0091unarodnom okru\u00c5\u00beenju i dobroj radnoj atmosferi, po\u00c5\u00a1aljite svoju radnu biografiju na email adresu career@jugopetrol.co.me najkasnije do 13. septembra.<\/p><p>Bi\u00c4\u0087e kontaktirani isklju\u00c4\u008divo kandidati koji budu odabrani za u\u00c5\u00bei krug selekcionog procesa.<\/p><br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **ADMIRINGLY** and tag RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ== when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ==). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Podgorica, ","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-merchandiser-jugopetrol-ad-1137234","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-merchandiser-jugopetrol-ad-1137234"},{"slug":"remote-cloud-computing-amazon-web-services-aws-1137231","id":"1137231","epoch":1788156315,"date":"2026-08-31T06:05:15+00:00","company":"Amazon Web Services (AWS)","company_logo":"","position":"Cloud Computing","tags":["education","exec","ops","engineer","amazon","web dev","cloud","aws"],"description":"<p><strong>Roles and Responsibilities - AWS cloud computing<\/strong><\/p><p><br><\/p><p><strong>Location - Hyderabad, Chennai, Kolkata, Pune, Bengaluru<\/strong><\/p><p><br><\/p><p><strong>Exp - 6 - 8 yrs<\/strong><\/p><p><br><\/p><br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **LOVE** and tag RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ== when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ==). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Telangana, ","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-cloud-computing-amazon-web-services-aws-1137231","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-cloud-computing-amazon-web-services-aws-1137231"},{"slug":"remote-commercial-building-estimator-complex-co-1137228","id":"1137228","epoch":1788137173,"date":"2026-08-31T00:46:13+00:00","company":"Complex Co.","company_logo":"","position":"Commercial Building Estimator","tags":["technical","customer support","microsoft","exec","junior","excel","recruiter"],"description":"<p>For more than 60 years, Complex Co. has been known for delivering award winning construction projects across the built environment.<\/p><p><br><\/p><p>Our skillful execution of quality projects is an expression of our personal and professional commitment to connecting and enhancing communities.<\/p><p><br><\/p><p>As our commercial building pipeline continues to grow, we are looking for an experienced Commercial Building Estimator to play a key role in shaping successful tenders, strengthening estimating capability, and supporting the continued expansion of our commercial building arm.<\/p><p><br><\/p><p>This role will be responsible for delivering accurate, competitive, and well-documented cost estimates for commercial building &amp; construction projects, while also providing day-to-day technical advice and mentoring to the estimating team.<\/p><p><br><\/p><p>This is a hands-on, influential role for someone who brings strong technical estimating expertise, sound commercial judgement, and the confidence to lead pricing activity across commercial building and construction opportunities.<\/p><p><br><\/p><p><strong>Key responsibilities<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>Prepare accurate and competitive cost estimates, budgets, and scopes of work for commercial building and construction tenders<\/li><li>Review tender documentation (drawings, specifications, RFTs, contracts) to confirm scope, risks, and opportunities<\/li><li>Conduct and\/or coordinate site inspections to assess conditions and identify construction risks<\/li><li>Perform and review quantity take-offs using Benchmark, Revu, and Excel<\/li><li>Prepare detailed cost build-ups, subcontractor comparisons, and pricing reconciliations<\/li><li>Analyse historical project data to support pricing accuracy and continuous improvement<\/li><li>Provide technical guidance and mentoring to Estimators<\/li><li>Act as first point of escalation for estimating queries and technical issues<\/li><li>Promote consistent estimating methodologies, tools, and documentation standards<\/li><li>Maintain effective working relationships with key subcontractors and suppliers<\/li><\/ul><p><br><\/p><p><strong>About you<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>Minimum 8+ years' experience in commercial building and construction estimating<\/li><li>Demonstrated experience preparing and leading complex commercial building tenders<\/li><li>Strong understanding of construction methodologies, contract review and risk identification, cost planning and pricing strategy<\/li><li>Proven ability to mentor and support junior and mid-level estimators<\/li><li>High-level competency in Benchmark, Bluebeam Revu, Microsoft Excel, and Microsoft Project (Intermediate level)<\/li><li>Ability to manage multiple tenders and competing deadlines<\/li><li>Strong written and verbal communication skills<\/li><li>Well-developed interpersonal, negotiation, and organisational skills<\/li><\/ul><p><br><\/p><p>If this sounds like the role for you please apply or reach out to Ebony Ison, ebony.ison@complexco.com.au<\/p><p><br><\/p><p>We are also advertising this role on SEEK Commercial Building Estimator Job in Canberra ACT - SEEK SEEK - Australia's no. 1 jobs, employment, career and recruitment site<\/p><br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **SLICK** and tag RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ== when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ==). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Canberra, ","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-commercial-building-estimator-complex-co-1137228","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-commercial-building-estimator-complex-co-1137228"},{"slug":"remote-enterprise-architect-l0-wipro-1137226","id":"1137226","epoch":1788135417,"date":"2026-08-31T00:16:57+00:00","company":"Wipro","company_logo":"","position":"ENTERPRISE ARCHITECT L0","tags":["architecture","design","digital nomad"],"description":"Job description:<br><br>Job Description \u00cd\u008f \u00cd\u008f \u00cd\u008f \u00cd\u008f <p>Mandatory Skills: Enterprise Architecting .<\/p><p>\u00c2\u00a0<\/p><p>Experience: 8-10 Years<br>.<\/p><p>\u00c2\u00a0<\/p><p>Reinvent your world. We are building a modern Wipro. We are an end-to-end digital transformation partner with the boldest ambitions. To realize them, we need people inspired by reinvention. Of yourself, your career, and your skills. We want to see the constant evolution of our business and our industry. It has always been in our DNA - as the world around us changes, so do we. Join a business powered by purpose and a place that empowers you to design your own reinvention.<\/p><br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **LUCK** and tag RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ== when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ==). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Chennai, ","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-enterprise-architect-l0-wipro-1137226","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-enterprise-architect-l0-wipro-1137226"},{"slug":"remote-ai-engineer-data-apis-benzinga-1137224","id":"1137224","epoch":1788123601,"date":"2026-08-30T21:00:01+00:00","company":"Benzinga","company_logo":"","position":"AI Engineer Data APIs","tags":["golang","video","engineer"],"description":"Remote - Before you read further: applying to this role requires a Loom video walkthrough under 5 minutes of the best thing you have built, plus a repo or live link. Tell us the hardest problem you hit and how you solved it. Focus on architecture decisions and tradeoffs, not a f...<br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **CHARMINGLY** and tag RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ== when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ==). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-ai-engineer-data-apis-benzinga-1137224","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-ai-engineer-data-apis-benzinga-1137224"},{"slug":"remote-gtm-wonderful-1137225","id":"1137225","epoch":1788119827,"date":"2026-08-30T19:57:07+00:00","company":"Wonderful","company_logo":"","position":"GTM","tags":["saas","salesforce","sys admin","technical","marketing","exec","senior","sales"],"description":"<strong><strong>Role Overview:<br><br><\/strong><\/strong>You\u00e2\u0080\u0099ll lead and close high-stakes enterprise deals across the region, expand existing relationships, and create durable revenue streams with major organizations.<br><br><ul><li>Build and grow trusted relationships with CxOs, IT leaders, and Customer Service executives in large enterprises. <\/li><li>Drive measurable growth within the accounts you own, turning them into long-term success stories. <\/li><li>Expand Wonderful\u00e2\u0080\u0099s footprint by opening new doors and landing fresh enterprise customers. <\/li><li>Hit - and exceed - activity, pipeline, and revenue targets, setting the bar for sales excellence. <\/li><li>Keep customer details sharp and actionable in Salesforce: use cases, purchase timelines, next steps, and forecasts. <\/li><li>Sell on value, not features using a solution-based approach that proves real business impact for customers. <br><br><\/li><\/ul><strong><strong>Requirements:<br><br><\/strong><\/strong><ul><li>7+ years of smashing Sales quotas in SaaS or AI-driven solutions, consistently closing large, complex accounts with multi-stakeholder cycles<\/li><li>Exceptional communication, presentation, and negotiation skills<\/li><li>The ability to work independently, manage a sales pipeline, and prioritize effectively<\/li><li>Excellent English (written and spoken) plus fluency in local language<\/li><li>A passion for artificial intelligence and a \"get-it-done\" attitude<\/li><li>A \"hunter\" mentality with a track record of generating new leads and closing deals<\/li><li>A proven ability to navigate and win in early-stage, high-growth environments, staying sharp and effective with limited oversight<\/li><li>Strong relationships with CxOs and senior decision-makers at enterprise level with the credibility to open new doors fast<\/li><li>The skill to cut through tech jargon and turn technical capabilities into clear, compelling business value that makes executives lean in<\/li><li>Proven wins working hand-in-hand with System Integrators and Hyperscalers to drive joint success<\/li><li>Bachelor\u00e2\u0080\u0099s Degree (or equivalent hustle and expertise)<br><br><\/li><\/ul>Candidate Privacy Notice<br><br><br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **CLEAN** and tag RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ== when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ==). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Bridgetown, ","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-gtm-wonderful-1137225","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-gtm-wonderful-1137225"},{"slug":"remote-airport-ground-staff-customer-service-associate-fronix-services-1137254","id":"1137254","epoch":1788114600,"date":"2026-08-30T18:30:00+00:00","company":"Fronix Services","company_logo":"","position":"Airport Ground Staff Customer Service Associate","tags":["sys admin","infosec","education","customer support","testing","c","exec","engineer","hr","travel"],"description":"<strong>Contact Us 7082570898<br><\/strong>We are Hiring for Airport Ground Staff \/ Customer Service Associate for Leading Airlines @ IGI Thiruvananthapuram Airport for Both Males and Females ( Only Freshers )<br><br>Job Responsibility when you work at the Airport<br>Greeting and welcoming passengers, and responding to questions.Checking in baggage.Making reservations.Assisting with airline Gates &amp; SeatsHelping customers with Proper Luggage Tags and Pasting Bar CodesAssisting disabled passengers and those with small children.<br>If you are Complete Fresher, then company will offer you OJT Online or Offline and after OJT Starting Salary will be 25,000 Rs to 45,000 Rs Per Month +Cab+ Perks<br>Required Experience, Skills, and Qualifications:-<br>Minimum 10+2 or a GraduateExcellent Communication skillsAge between 18-35 yrs.Flexibility with changing requirements regarding work hours \/ days, location and travel<br><strong>Contact Hr 7082570898<br><br><\/strong><br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **FORMIDABLE** and tag RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ== when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ==). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Thiruvananthapuram, ","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-airport-ground-staff-customer-service-associate-fronix-services-1137254","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-airport-ground-staff-customer-service-associate-fronix-services-1137254"},{"slug":"remote-professional-pat-tester-guardian-electrical-compliance-ltd-1137235","id":"1137235","epoch":1788106759,"date":"2026-08-30T16:19:19+00:00","company":"Guardian Electrical Compliance Ltd","company_logo":"","position":"Professional PAT Tester","tags":["microsoft","testing","sys admin","customer support","dev","excel","recruiter","non tech","digital nomad"],"description":"PAT Tester Required - Oxford \/ Milton Keynes Area<br>Guardian Electrical Compliance is looking for a high-calibre PAT Tester to join our growing team covering the Oxford and Milton Keynes area.<br><br>Requirements<br>\u00e2\u0080\u00a2City &amp; Guilds 2377 qualification (essential)<br>\u00e2\u0080\u00a2Full, clean UK driving licence (essential)<br>What We Offer<br>\u00e2\u0080\u00a2Starting salary of \u00c2\u00a331,000 per year<br>\u00e2\u0080\u00a245-hour week, Monday to Friday<br>\u00e2\u0080\u00a29-hour working days<br>\u00e2\u0080\u00a2Company vehicle provided<br>\u00e2\u0080\u00a2Fuel card provided<br>\u00e2\u0080\u00a2All testing equipment supplied<br>Productivity Expectations<br>\u00e2\u0080\u00a2KPI target of approximately 300-350 items tested per day (around 38 items per hour)<br><br>Technology &amp; Support<br>We've invested heavily in systems and processes that make achieving these targets straightforward and efficient:<br>\u00e2\u0080\u00a2Pre-printed labels<br>\u00e2\u0080\u00a2Barcode scanning technology<br>\u00e2\u0080\u00a2Clarity software interface<br>\u00e2\u0080\u00a2PTSG's bespoke CRM system<br>\u00e2\u0080\u00a2Automated certificate and report generation<br>\u00e2\u0080\u00a2Reports sent directly to clients on the same day once work is signed off<br>\u00e2\u0080\u00a2Automatic Excel report generation for upload to client portals, including TraQit<br>\u00e2\u0080\u00a2No manual writing of results<br>\u00e2\u0080\u00a2No hand-written labels<br>\u00e2\u0080\u00a2Minimal administration<br>\u00e2\u0080\u00a2Fully streamlined digital workflow<br><br>Unlike many PAT testing companies, we provide both the company vehicle and all testing equipment, allowing our engineers to focus on carrying out quality inspections rather than covering their own business costs.<br><br>If you're an experienced PAT Tester looking to join a professional organisation with excellent systems, support and long-term opportunities, we'd love to hear from you.<br><br>Interested? Send me a direct message or visit the Guardian Electrical Compliance website to apply.<br>#PATTesting #PATTester #ElectricalCompliance #Jobs #OxfordJobs #MiltonKeynesJobs #Recruitment #GuardianElectricalCompliance #PTSG #ElectricalJobs<br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **BALANCED** and tag RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ== when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ==). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Oxford, ","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-professional-pat-tester-guardian-electrical-compliance-ltd-1137235","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-professional-pat-tester-guardian-electrical-compliance-ltd-1137235"},{"slug":"remote-mot-tester-mr-clutch-autocentres-1137218","id":"1137218","epoch":1788060773,"date":"2026-08-30T03:32:53+00:00","company":"Mr Clutch Autocentres","company_logo":"","position":"MOT Tester","tags":["testing","sys admin","education","finance","scheme","non tech"],"description":"<p><span>We have a fabulous opportunity for an experienced MOT Tester to join our friendly team.<\/span><\/p><p><span>We offer a competitive salary with an outstanding bonus scheme, ongoing training and the opportunity to progress within the company for the right candidate.<\/span><\/p><p><span>Current employee quotes:<\/span><\/p><p><span><span>1.<\/span><\/span><em><strong>\"Such a good bonus scheme, the BEST I have had from anywhere I have worked. It is more realistic here as it goes on your own productivity and not anyone else's\"<\/strong>. <\/em><span>Mr Clutch employee, employed over 6 years.<\/span><\/p><p><span><span>2.<\/span><\/span><em><span><strong>\"Most places you have to hit a centre bonus, but here you can hit a bonus no matter what, as long as you are productive, it is achieveable. I know I am going to get my bonus because of what I do, not anyone else!\"<\/strong><\/span><\/em><span>Mr Clutch employee, employed over 8 years.<\/span><\/p><p><span>Our MOT Tester positions are dedicated positions that play a crucial role within our branches. By carrying out MOT Testing to DVSA standards on a variety of vehicle types, our MOT Testers assist with meeting our customer needs and work closely with the staff team to provide an efficient workshop flow. If you hold a current DVSA card, enjoy working as part of a friendly team, and take pride in your work, please do submit your CV at your earliest opportunity.<\/span><\/p><p><span>Only MOT Testers with appropriate qualifications should apply. The ideal applicant will have experience and be skilled in all makes and models of cars. In return, we offer excellent earning potential with a good bonus scheme and working practices.<\/span><\/p><p><span>Purpose of Job<\/span><\/p><ul><li><span>You will berequired to conduct MOT's in line with DVSA guidelines and to adhere to company policies.<\/span><\/li><li><span>You will be required to ensure all MOT's are carried out in line with DVSA guidelines to ensure full compliance<\/span><\/li><li><span>You will be required to ensure all work is carried out observing safe working practices of self and others<\/span><\/li><\/ul><p><span>Salary: Negotiable<\/span><\/p><p><span>Hours: 48 per week (Mon to Fri 8.30am to 5.30pm &amp; 8.30-5 Sat)<\/span><\/p><p><span>Benefits:We are committed to the development and career progression of all personnel and offer exceptional in-house training, along with an excellent bonus system that rewards both productivity and efficiency.<\/span><\/p><ul><li><span>Potential for 44 days paid leave(including bank holidays)<\/span><\/li><li><span>Excellent bonus scheme<\/span><\/li><li><span>Development opportunities<\/span><\/li><li><span>Career progression<\/span><\/li><li><span>Training at our IMI approved Training Academies (Strood\/Reading)<\/span><\/li><li><span>Uniform<\/span><\/li><li><span>Company discount<\/span><\/li><li><span>Pension scheme<br><\/span><\/li><\/ul><p>LNKD1_UKTJ<\/p><br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **CELEBRATED** and tag RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ== when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ==). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Oxford, ","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-mot-tester-mr-clutch-autocentres-1137218","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-mot-tester-mr-clutch-autocentres-1137218"},{"slug":"remote-shunter-stobart-1137216","id":"1137216","epoch":1788060662,"date":"2026-08-30T03:31:02+00:00","company":"Stobart","company_logo":"","position":"Shunter","tags":["c","scheme","ops","legal","medical","recruiter","full time","non tech"],"description":"<strong>Company Description<\/strong><p><strong>Stobart<\/strong>(Part of the Culina Group) is a leading ambient transport and logistics business, providing services to many of the UKs best known brands across core consumer and retail sectors.<\/p><p>We are now recruiting for a<strong>Shunter<\/strong>to join our<strong>Northampton, Swan Valley<\/strong>on a full-time and permanent basis.<\/p><p><strong>Shift Pattern: <\/strong>Working4 on 4 off - 06:00-18:00<\/p><p><strong>Salary:<\/strong>\u00c2\u00a333,509 per annum. Paid Bi-Weekly<\/p><strong>Job Description<\/strong><p>To ensure the timely trailer movements, on and off loading bays and where applicable to deliver a shunt load from one location to another, as instructed, in line with Company standards and operational requirements<strong>.<\/strong><\/p><p><strong>Key Duties of a Shunter:<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>This role will include inter-depot movements.<\/li><li>To place trailers to the required areas as per instructions<\/li><li>To use two way radios to keep in contact with areas of the operation as necessary<\/li><li>To ensure you carry out all safety checks, as designated by the company.<\/li><li>To ensure that you report defects, accident damage and any incidents as soon as they are found.<\/li><li>To ensure fridges are set at the correct temperature, in line with loaded product temperature requirements.<\/li><li>To ensure fridge diesel tanks have adequate fuel at all times.<\/li><li>To always be professional and courteous when communicating with your colleagues.<\/li><li>Reporting any breaches in speed limits by drivers and sub contractors to the transport department.<\/li><li>Keeping vehicle parking area layouts as they should be and reporting any issues of debris to the site services team<\/li><li>Ensure that company standards of hygiene and housekeeping, in your areas of work, are maintained at all times<\/li><li>To ensure you are working in line with Health &amp; Safety legislation<\/li><\/ul><strong>Qualifications<\/strong><ul><li><strong>A Full C+E entitlement is needed for this position.<\/strong><\/li><li>Previous shunting experience<\/li><li>Experience of working in a very fast paced environment<\/li><li>Written and verbal communication<\/li><li>Ability to work to challenging deadlines in a pressurised environment<\/li><li>Self disciplined and motivated<\/li><\/ul><strong>Additional Information<\/strong><p>As part of our drive to make Stobarta great place to work. We are proud to be an inclusive and diverse organisation where we are committed to employee development and recognising success for hard working performers.<\/p><p>Our dedicated learning and development programmes are open to every employee to give you the opportunity to shape your own future within logistics and continue to work in an environment where team culture thrives.<\/p><p>Our People are the driving force behind our success, which is why we offer a wide range of benefits which include:<\/p><ul><li><strong>Annual Leave.<\/strong><\/li><li><strong>Fortnightly pay.<\/strong><\/li><li><strong>Pension scheme <\/strong>we want colleagues to enjoy a comfortable retirements so we offer agreat contribution of<strong>5%<\/strong>employee and<strong>3%<\/strong>employer<\/li><li><strong>Life Assurance<\/strong>- x 2 your annual salary<\/li><li><strong>Wellness <\/strong>Via our Employee Assistance Programmewe offer immediate access to a confidential telephone counselling and legal information service that operates 24 hours a days, 365 days a year<\/li><li><strong>Eye Care Vouchers <\/strong>We can provide you with substantial savings with free eye tests and discounts on prescription glasses<\/li><li><strong>Reward &amp; Recognition <\/strong>We recognise that employees have gone the extra mile via Employee of the month and year, special recognition and long service awards.<\/li><\/ul><p>If you meet the requirements for the above role and are looking for your next career opportunity please apply now and become a part of our #WinningTeam!<br><\/p><p>LNKD1_UKTJ<\/p><br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **FORTUNATE** and tag RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ== when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ==). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Northampton, ","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-shunter-stobart-1137216","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-shunter-stobart-1137216"},{"slug":"remote-customer-service-agent-thrifty-car-and-van-rental-1137219","id":"1137219","epoch":1788060661,"date":"2026-08-30T03:31:01+00:00","company":"Thrifty Car and Van Rental","company_logo":"","position":"Customer Service Agent","tags":["testing","sys admin","education","finance","scheme","non tech","customer support","marketing","admin","ops"],"description":"<p><strong>Job Title:<\/strong><span><span><strong>Customer Service Agent<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/p><p><strong>Location: Exeter Head Office - Full Time<\/strong><\/p><p><span><strong>Hours: 40 hours Monday-Friday + Saturday shift rota<\/strong><\/span><\/p><p><strong>Benefits:<\/strong><\/p><ul><li><strong>22 days holiday, increasing to 27 plus bank holidays<\/strong><\/li><li><strong><span>Free onsite parking<\/span><\/strong><\/li><li><strong><span>Free onsite gym<\/span><\/strong><\/li><li><strong><span>Company pension scheme<\/span><\/strong><\/li><li><strong><span>Employee discount scheme<\/span><\/strong><\/li><li><strong><span>Funded Summer and Christmas events <\/span><\/strong><\/li><li><strong><span>Cycle to Work Scheme<\/span><\/strong><\/li><li><strong><span>Discounted car hire rates<\/span><\/strong><\/li><\/ul><p><strong>The Role:<\/strong><\/p><p>You will be a valued member of a team, providing support through a variety of communications, accurate recording of data and various tasks that impact on our services, taking inbound and outbound calls from our branches and customers. You will be creating an exceptional experience for customers, whilst building trusting relationships and handling queries with confidence to provide all National Account customers with a dedicated vehicle hire reservation service.<\/p><p>No prior experience is necessary, full training will be given.<\/p><p>This is an office-based role. The candidate will be required to work 40 hours per week as well as Saturdays on a rota basis.<\/p><p><strong>Responsibilities:<\/strong><\/p><ul><li><span>To provide outstanding customer service and exhibit excellent communications skills when interacting with clients<\/span><\/li><li><span>Regularly monitor personal and team inboxes and respond to emails<\/span><\/li><li><span>Ensure all customer complaints are resolved to the customers satisfaction<\/span><\/li><li><span>To process data accurately using a variety of <span>inhouse <\/span>systems<\/span><\/li><li><span>Answer calls and promptly resolve any requests or queries<\/span><\/li><\/ul><p><span><span><strong>The Candidate:<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/p><ul><li><span><span><span>Happy to work independently, as well as in a<span> part of the<\/span> team<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li><li><span><span><span>Excellent communication skills<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li><li><span><span><span>Strong organisational skills and attention to detail<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li><li><span><span><span>Ability to multitask<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li><li><span><span><span>IT literate<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li><\/ul><ul><li><strong><span>About Us:<\/span><\/strong><span>Thrifty is the largest privately-owned leasing company in the UK, with 81 locations nationwide. Our Head Office is the central hub of our operations, and we are searching for an exceptional administrator to join our team.<\/span><\/li><li><span>As one of the leading rental companies in the UK, we owe our success to a comprehensive fleet and a commitment to excellent customer service. With our growth comes exciting opportunities to become part of our family business, where our peopleremainat the heart of everything we do.<\/span><\/li><li><span>Shape the future with us<strong>APPLY NOW<\/strong>and join our team!<br><br><\/span><\/li><\/ul><p>LNKD1_UKTJ<\/p><br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **BOLSTER** and tag RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ== when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ==). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Exeter, ","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-customer-service-agent-thrifty-car-and-van-rental-1137219","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-customer-service-agent-thrifty-car-and-van-rental-1137219"},{"slug":"remote-handyperson-wellburn-care-homes-ltd-1137217","id":"1137217","epoch":1788060641,"date":"2026-08-30T03:30:41+00:00","company":"Wellburn Care Homes Ltd","company_logo":"","position":"Handyperson","tags":["c","scheme","ops","legal","medical","recruiter","full time","non tech","education","golang"],"description":"<p><span><strong>Benefits <\/strong><\/span><\/p><p><span>As well as working alongside a dedicated team, working at Wellburn also brings extra benefits including:<\/span><\/p><ul><li>Excellent rates of pay<\/li><li>Ongoing wellbeing and mental health initiatives<\/li><li>Home and Tech Scheme<\/li><li>Cycle to Work Scheme<\/li><li>Shining Star Award \u00e2\u0080\u0093 to recognise staff who go above and beyond<\/li><li>\u00c2\u00a3500 refer a friend scheme*<\/li><li>Staff Lottery<\/li><li>Birthday wishes \u00e2\u0080\u0093 prize draw each month to have your birthday off. <\/li><\/ul><p><span>*subject to terms <\/span><\/p><p><br><\/p><p><strong><span>A little bit about us<\/span><\/strong><\/p><p><span>Here at Wellburn, our lovely family run business operates a little differently to a lot of other businesses. We don't hire robots. We hire people. Everyone is different, and we love that. Our recruitment policy is as much to do with personality as it is about qualifications. We need you to fit in and be part of the team. Part of the family. <\/span><\/p><p><br><\/p><p><span><strong>About the role <\/strong><\/span><\/p><p><span>The Handyperson is key to the welfare of our residents at Wellburn Care by ensuring high standards of general maintenance to the care home and surrounding areas. We are looking for a handyperson who are self-motivated and can prioritise their own workload with a good general knowledge of all aspects of maintenance including basic plumbing, joinery, and household electrical fittings.<\/span><\/p><p><span>Our Handyperson will have a keen eye to identify general maintenance work that is required to keep our homes safe and as comfortable as possible for the residents. You will be responsible for all minor repairs within the home as well as reporting defects, undertaking Health and Safety checks (training will be given) and maintaining the appropriate records. <\/span><\/p><p><span>Sounding good? We want to hear from you!<\/span><\/p><p><span><strong>Apply <\/strong><\/span><\/p><p><span>If you like what you read simply click the apply button, enter some quick details and submit your CV. It really couldn't be easier. Click submit and leave the rest to us. We'll then get back in touch with you as soon as possible - usually within three working days.<\/span><\/p><p><br><\/p><span>This role is subject to a full enhanced DBS check, in line with Wellburn Care Homes Safeguarding Policy.<\/span><p><br><\/p><p><span>*We are not currently able to offer sponsorship for this role. <\/span><\/p><p><br><br><br><\/p><p>LNKD1_UKTJ<\/p><br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **HUMOUR** and tag RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ== when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ==). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Berwick-Upon-Tweed, ","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-handyperson-wellburn-care-homes-ltd-1137217","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-handyperson-wellburn-care-homes-ltd-1137217"},{"slug":"remote-wireperson-trant-engineering-limited-1137221","id":"1137221","epoch":1788060601,"date":"2026-08-30T03:30:01+00:00","company":"TRANT ENGINEERING LIMITED","company_logo":"","position":"Wireperson","tags":["testing","sys admin","education","finance","scheme","non tech","customer support","marketing","admin","ops","exec","virtual assistant","microsoft","sales","design","technical","supervisor","assembly","engineer","digital nomad"],"description":"<strong>Description<\/strong> <strong>Trant Te-Tech<\/strong> design, custom build and install a wide range of high quality control panels, motor control centres (MCCs) and automation systems, offering conventional, intelligent and withdrawable systems with outstanding reliability and functionality.<br>We are currently looking for a proven <strong>Wireperson<\/strong> to join our workshop based near Totton, Southampton. <br> <em><br>The Role<\/em> The <strong>Wire Person <\/strong>is responsible for the accurate assembly and wiring of control panels, MCCs, and automation systems in accordance with electrical drawings, specifications, and applicable standards. The role plays a key part in ensuring assemblies meet quality, safety, and compliance requirements prior to inspection and testing.<strong>What Youll Be Doing<\/strong><strong>Technical Responsibilities - Panel &amp; MCC Wiring<\/strong><ul> <li>Carry out wiring of control panels, MCCs, and automation systems to approved schematics and wiring diagrams.<\/li> <li>Install and terminate power, control, and instrumentation cabling.<\/li> <li>Assemble and wire MCCs and control panels.<\/li> <li>Ensure correct segregation, routing and termination in line with design and compliance requirements.<\/li> <\/ul> <strong>Technical Support &amp; Collaboration<\/strong><ul> <li>Accurately interpret electrical schematics, wiring diagrams, BOMs, and general arrangement drawings.<\/li> <li>Mark up drawings where required to reflect as-built changes.<\/li> <li>Follow work instructions and build documentation.<\/li> <li>Work collaboratively with fellow wire-people, testers, and supervisors to meet production targets.<\/li> <li>Support improvements in wiring practices, layout, and efficiency. <\/li> <li>Provide feedback to supervisors on build issues or potential improvements.<\/li> <\/ul><strong>SHE&amp;Q and Compliance<\/strong><ul> <li>Carry out self-checks and peer checks prior to formal testing.<\/li> <li>Identify and report defects, non-conformances or drawing discrepancies.<\/li> <li>Work safely in accordance with company H&amp;S procedures and UK legislation.<\/li> <li>Maintain a clean, tidy and organised working area.<\/li> <li>Use tools, equipment, and PPE correctly at all times.<\/li> <\/ul> <strong>Key Interfaces:<br><\/strong>Internal Interfaces<ul> <li>Workshop Supervisor.<\/li> <li>Production Manager.<\/li> <li>Test Engineer.<\/li> <li>Design &amp; Engineering Teams.<\/li> <li>Automation Team.<\/li> <li>Stores \/ Logistic.<\/li> <li>Quality Team.<\/li> <\/ul>External Interfaces<ul> <li>Clients \/ Inspectors (as required)<\/li> <li>Suppliers (limited)<\/li> <\/ul> <strong>Core Values<br><br><\/strong>Uphold and promote the Companys Core Values  Care, Trust, Respect and Sustainability.<br><br> <strong>What Were Looking For<\/strong><strong>Essential<\/strong><ul> <li>NVQ Level 3 (or equivalent) in Electrical Installation, Panel Wiring, or Electrical Engineering.<\/li> <li>Ability to read and interpret electrical schematics, wiring diagrams, and GA drawings.<\/li> <li>Working knowledge of electrical safety practices and workshop H&amp;S requirements.<\/li> <li>Familiarity with quality-controlled manufacturing processes.<\/li> <li>Proven experience wiring control panels, MCCs, or similar electrical assemblies.<\/li> <li>Experience terminating power, control, and instrumentation wiring.<\/li> <li>Experience working from schematics, wiring schedules, and BOMs.<\/li> <li>Experience completing work to high quality and safety standards in a workshop environment.<\/li> <li>Applicants must be legally authorised to work in the UK, as we are unable to sponsor work visas for this role.<\/li> <\/ul><strong>Desirable<\/strong><ul> <li>18th Edition (BS 7671) qualification.<\/li> <li>Awareness or training relating to BS EN 61439-2:2021.<\/li> <li>Manufacturer or industry training on MCCs, switchgear andautomation systems.<\/li> <li>First Aid or IOSH Working Safely certification.<\/li> <li>Experience wiring MCCs and control panels.<\/li> <li>Experience with PLC I\/O wiring, automation panels, and instrumentation.<\/li> <li>Experience supporting test and inspection activities, including rectification of faults.<\/li> <li>Experience working on custom-built, client-specific panel builds.<\/li> <\/ul><strong>Why Join Trant ?<\/strong>At Trant Engineering, we deliver complex, high-value engineering and construction projects across the UK. From process and water treatment to energy infrastructure upgrades, we play a key role in delivering and protecting critical national infrastructure  shaping the systems that communities and industries rely on every day.<br><br>Our teams design and deliver full EPC solutions, combining technical excellence with practical, hands-on delivery. We offer end-to-end capabilities  from concept and design through to manufacturing, construction and commissioning utilising a continually evolving in-house expertise. This means youll work on projects that are varied, challenging and genuinely impactful.<br><br>Our multi-disciplinary teams bring together specialists in civil, mechanical, electrical, process, instrumentation, and control &amp; automation engineering, alongside our in-house manufacturing of control panels, MCCs, PLCs and SCADA systems. With over 1,000 people and a strong, growing pipeline of work, its an exciting time to join Trant. We are committed to helping our people succeed through our Career Development Association, providing structured support, mentoring and clear pathways to help you reach your full potential.<br><br> Whether youre starting out or looking to take your next career step, Trant offers the chance to develop, progress and make a real difference.<br><br> <em>Our company benefits package includes:<\/em><ul> <li>Competitive rates.<\/li> <li>28 days holiday (including bank holidays).<\/li> <li>Options to buy additional holiday via salary sacrifice.<\/li> <li>Company pension scheme.<\/li> <li>Employee assistance program.<\/li> <li>Discretionary annual bonus.<\/li> <\/ul><strong>Join us and be part of something bigger.<br><\/strong><p>LNKD1_UKTJ<\/p><br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **MAGNIFICENTLY** and tag RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ== when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ==). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Southampton, ","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-wireperson-trant-engineering-limited-1137221","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-wireperson-trant-engineering-limited-1137221"},{"slug":"remote-apply-now-send-veritas-your-resume-dont-close-website-elements-recruitment-australia-1137201","id":"1137201","epoch":1787958928,"date":"2026-08-28T23:15:28+00:00","company":"Elements Recruitment Australia","company_logo":"","position":"APPLY NOW Send Veritas your Resume DON'T CLOSE WEBSITE","tags":["recruiter","non tech"],"description":"APPLY NOW - to send Veritas Recruitment your resume.<br><br>Please refer to the Privacy Policy on our website. Accepting Candidates<br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **FAULTLESS** and tag RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ== when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ==). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Clayton, ","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-apply-now-send-veritas-your-resume-dont-close-website-elements-recruitment-australia-1137201","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-apply-now-send-veritas-your-resume-dont-close-website-elements-recruitment-australia-1137201"},{"slug":"remote-residential-valuer-acumentis-group-1137214","id":"1137214","epoch":1787958489,"date":"2026-08-28T23:08:09+00:00","company":"Acumentis Group","company_logo":"","position":"Residential Valuer","tags":["customer support","marketing","exec","finance","sales"],"description":"Introduction:<br><br><strong>About The Company<br><br><\/strong>Acumentis is Australia's only independent ASX-listed property valuation and advisory firm. With 350+ team members across 45 locations, we combine national scale with local support and a strong focus on service, inclusion and professional development.<br><br>Description:<br><br><strong>About The Role<br><br><\/strong>As a Residential Valuer, you will be a key member of our team, collaborating with fellow Valuers and Directors to achieve Acumentis' business objectives and regional goals. Your responsibilities will include:<br><br><ul><li>High-Quality Valuations: Deliver valuations of the highest quality, adhering to client and company guidelines, and meeting required service level agreements (SLAs).<\/li><li>Market Expertise: Maintain a deep understanding of sales trends and market conditions to inform valuation practices.<\/li><li>Client Relationship Management: Build and nurture strong relationships with clients, contributing to business development initiatives.<\/li><li>Strategic Collaboration: Report regularly to the Regional Director and work closely to achieve targeted outcomes.<br><br><br><\/li><\/ul>This position is also open to an Associate Director or Director role for the right candidate.<br><br>Skills and Experiences:<br><br><strong>About You<br><br><\/strong>You\u00e2\u0080\u0099ll be a great fit for us if:<br><br><ul><li>You have a minimum 2 year's relevant experience in residential valuations<\/li><li>You possess tertiary qualifications in a relevant Property Degree<\/li><li>You have a Certified Practising Valuer (CPV) Qualification <\/li><li>You have strong working knowledge of the residential property market in Port Macquarie and surrounding areas.<\/li><li>You have a great ability to create and maintain working relationships with clients and colleagues<br><br><br><\/li><\/ul><strong>We\u00e2\u0080\u0099ll be a great fit for you if:<br><br><\/strong><ul><li>You\u00e2\u0080\u0099d like an extra day of leave for your birthday, study or volunteer opportunities<\/li><li>You\u00e2\u0080\u0099d like to take advantage of employee benefits such as bank partnerships, employee discounts and a full wellness calendar of activities - with new benefits added each month!<\/li><li>You\u00e2\u0080\u0099re looking to join a business with a strong national presence, where relocation can be supported<\/li><li>You\u00e2\u0080\u0099d like a position with a strong client base and steady stream of work<\/li><li>You\u00e2\u0080\u0099d like to ensure your life\/work balance through flexible work arrangements<\/li><li>You\u00e2\u0080\u0099d like mentoring from industry leaders to guide your career, and create a guaranteed pathway for our twice-yearly promotion program <br><br><br><\/li><\/ul><em>It is a condition of employment that staff are to obtain National Police Clearance (paid for by the business).<br><br><\/em><strong>How To Apply<br><br><\/strong>If working with Acumentis in this period of growth sounds like something you are looking for, please apply online via the link provided. If you have any questions regarding the role, please contact the People Team (people@acumentis.com.au). We are unable to consider emailed applications.<br><br>Acumentis embraces and values the diversity of culture, working arrangements, sexual orientation and gender identity to ensure our workforce is representative of the community that we work within. We promote a workplace that actively seeks to include and welcome the unique contributions of all people. We embrace and celebrate the value of Indigenous people, their skills and their contribution to our organisation.<br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **SIMPLIFY** and tag RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ== when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ==). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Port Macquarie, ","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-residential-valuer-acumentis-group-1137214","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-residential-valuer-acumentis-group-1137214"},{"slug":"remote-higienizador-de-carros-macae-rj-localizaampco-1137203","id":"1137203","epoch":1787956674,"date":"2026-08-28T22:37:54+00:00","company":"Localiza&amp;Co","company_logo":"","position":"HIGIENIZADOR DE CARROS MACA\u00c3\u0089 RJ","tags":[],"description":"<strong>LOCALIZA&amp;CO<br><br><\/strong>Estar em constante evolu\u00c3\u00a7\u00c3\u00a3o nos trouxe at\u00c3\u00a9 aqui. Ao lado de talentos e habilidades m\u00c3\u00baltiplas nos conectamos em busca da nossa motiva\u00c3\u00a7\u00c3\u00a3o: construir o futuro da mobilidade sustent\u00c3\u00a1vel. \u00c3\u0089 por meio da valoriza\u00c3\u00a7\u00c3\u00a3o da individualidade de cada um que impulsionamos o nosso movimento para conquistar resultados extraordin\u00c3\u00a1rios, desenvolver nossas opera\u00c3\u00a7\u00c3\u00b5es e criar solu\u00c3\u00a7\u00c3\u00b5es para os nossos clientes.Somos apaixonados por nossa hist\u00c3\u00b3ria, por nossas ideias e pela capacidade de realiz\u00c3\u00a1-las.Sabemos que juntos, todos vamos mais longe. \u00c3\u0089 assim que conectamos a Localiza&amp;Co com o futuro.<br><br><strong>O QUE VOC\u00c3\u008a IR\u00c3\u0081 FAZER COMO HIGIENIZADOR DE CARROS<br><br><\/strong><ul><li> Lavar os carros dispon\u00c3\u00adveis para venda conforme determina\u00c3\u00a7\u00c3\u00a3o da lideran\u00c3\u00a7a, observando rigorosamente as partes internas e externas;<\/li><li> Executar a calibragem dos pneus dos carros, conforme a tabela de calibragem e ligar os carros frequentemente para garantir a durabilidade da bateria;<\/li><li> Contribuir na identifica\u00c3\u00a7\u00c3\u00a3o de problemas nos ve\u00c3\u00adculos, atrav\u00c3\u00a9s de comunica\u00c3\u00a7\u00c3\u00a3o ao l\u00c3\u00adder, sobre qualquer defeito, avaria ou falta de acess\u00c3\u00b3rios observados nos carros.<br><br><br><\/li><\/ul><strong>O QUE PRECISAMOS<br><br><\/strong><ul><li> CNH categoria B h\u00c3\u00a1, no m\u00c3\u00adnimo, 1 ano<\/li><li> Ensino fundamental completo<\/li><li> Experi\u00c3\u00aancia com servi\u00c3\u00a7os que exigem esfor\u00c3\u00a7o f\u00c3\u00adsico<\/li><li> Trabalho em equipe<br><br><br><\/li><\/ul><strong>BENEF\u00c3\u008dCIOS<br><br><\/strong><ul><li> Uniforme<\/li><li> Participa\u00c3\u00a7\u00c3\u00a3o nos Lucros<\/li><li> Vale Alimenta\u00c3\u00a7\u00c3\u00a3o<\/li><li> Vale Refei\u00c3\u00a7\u00c3\u00a3o<\/li><li> Conv\u00c3\u00aanio M\u00c3\u00a9dico<\/li><li> Conv\u00c3\u00aanio Odontol\u00c3\u00b3gico<\/li><li> Gympass<\/li><li> Previd\u00c3\u00aancia Privada<\/li><li> Aux\u00c3\u00adlio Creche<\/li><li> Vale Transporte<\/li><li> Acesso ilimitado a diversos cursos da nossa Universidade Localiza<\/li><li> Programas internos de treinamento e desenvolvimento<\/li><li> Desconto em compra e aluguel de ve\u00c3\u00adculos<br><br><br><\/li><\/ul><strong>QUAL SER\u00c3\u0081 A JORNADA DO PROCESSO SELETIVO?<br><br><\/strong><ul><li> Cadastro<\/li><li> Testes Online<\/li><li> V\u00c3\u00addeo<\/li><li> An\u00c3\u00a1lise do seu perfil<\/li><li> Entrevistas<\/li><li> Proposta<br><br><br><\/li><\/ul>Se voc\u00c3\u00aa \u00c3\u00a9 uma pessoa com defici\u00c3\u00aancia e est\u00c3\u00a1 em d\u00c3\u00bavida se alguma das nossas vagas \u00c3\u00a9 pra voc\u00c3\u