s dispon\u00c3\u00adveis para venda conforme determina\u00c3\u00a7\u00c3\u00a3o da lideran\u00c3\u00a7a, observando rigorosamente as partes internas e externas;<\/li><li> Executar a calibragem dos pneus dos carros, conforme a tabela de calibragem e ligar os carros frequentemente para garantir a durabilidade da bateria;<\/li><li> Contribuir na identifica\u00c3\u00a7\u00c3\u00a3o de problemas nos ve\u00c3\u00adculos, atrav\u00c3\u00a9s de comunica\u00c3\u00a7\u00c3\u00a3o ao l\u00c3\u00adder, sobre qualquer defeito, avaria ou falta de acess\u00c3\u00b3rios observados nos carros.<br><br><br><\/li><\/ul><strong>O QUE PRECISAMOS<br><br><\/strong><ul><li> CNH categoria B h\u00c3\u00a1, no m\u00c3\u00adnimo, 1 ano<\/li><li> Ensino fundamental completo<\/li><li> Experi\u00c3\u00aancia com servi\u00c3\u00a7os que exigem esfor\u00c3\u00a7o f\u00c3\u00adsico<\/li><li> Trabalho em equipe<br><br><br><\/li><\/ul><strong>BENEF\u00c3\u008dCIOS<br><br><\/strong><ul><li> Uniforme<\/li><li> Participa\u00c3\u00a7\u00c3\u00a3o nos Lucros<\/li><li> Vale Alimenta\u00c3\u00a7\u00c3\u00a3o<\/li><li> Vale Refei\u00c3\u00a7\u00c3\u00a3o<\/li><li> Conv\u00c3\u00aanio M\u00c3\u00a9dico<\/li><li> Conv\u00c3\u00aanio Odontol\u00c3\u00b3gico<\/li><li> Gympass<\/li><li> Previd\u00c3\u00aancia Privada<\/li><li> Aux\u00c3\u00adlio Creche<\/li><li> Vale Transporte<\/li><li> Acesso ilimitado a diversos cursos da nossa Universidade Localiza<\/li><li> Programas internos de treinamento e desenvolvimento<\/li><li> Desconto em compra e aluguel de ve\u00c3\u00adculos<br><br><br><\/li><\/ul><strong>QUAL SER\u00c3\u0081 A JORNADA DO PROCESSO SELETIVO?<br><br><\/strong><ul><li> Cadastro<\/li><li> Testes Online<\/li><li> V\u00c3\u00addeo<\/li><li> An\u00c3\u00a1lise do seu perfil<\/li><li> Entrevistas<\/li><li> Proposta<br><br><br><\/li><\/ul>Se voc\u00c3\u00aa \u00c3\u00a9 uma pessoa com defici\u00c3\u00aancia e est\u00c3\u00a1 em d\u00c3\u00bavida se alguma das nossas vagas \u00c3\u00a9 pra voc\u00c3\u00aa, fique tranquilo. Voc\u00c3\u00aa pode se candidatar a qualquer uma delas!<br><br><strong>Viva a experi\u00c3\u00aancia de ser Localiza&amp;Co e venha construir o futuro da mobilidade com a gente!<\/strong><br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **HAPPIER** and tag RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ== when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ==). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Blumenau, ","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-higienizador-de-carros-blumenau-sc-localizaampco-1137269","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-higienizador-de-carros-blumenau-sc-localizaampco-1137269"},{"slug":"remote-store-manager-hola-moda-1137206","id":"1137206","epoch":1787945262,"date":"2026-08-28T19:27:42+00:00","company":"Hola Moda","company_logo":"","position":"Store Manager","tags":["exec","c"],"description":"<p>Buscamos un\/a<strong> Store Manager <\/strong>que lidere la tienda como un neg\u00c3\u00b3cio propio, impulsando resultados comerciales, desarrollando equipos inspiradores y ofreciendo una experiencia de cliente alineada con una marca global de moda accesible.<\/p><p>Ser\u00c3\u00a1s responsable de la experiencia integral del cliente, asegurando altos est\u00c3\u00a1ndares visuales y comerciales, una ejecuci\u00c3\u00b3n impecable en tienda y un fuerte enfoque OMNI. Liderar\u00c3\u00a1s al equipo con pasi\u00c3\u00b3n, mentalidad emprendedora y orientaci\u00c3\u00b3n a resultados.<\/p><p><br><\/p><p><strong>\u00c2\u00bfQu\u00c3\u00a9 har\u00c3\u00a1s?<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>Liderar y desarrollar a todo el equipo de tienda, creando una cultura inclusiva, colaborativa y de alto desempe\u00c3\u00b1o.<\/li><li>Impulsar ventas, rentabilidad y productividad mediante el an\u00c3\u00a1lisis de KPIs y planes de acci\u00c3\u00b3n comerciales.<\/li><li>Garantizar una ejecuci\u00c3\u00b3n visual fuerte y consistente, alineada a las estrategias globales y locales de la marca.<\/li><li>Asegurar una experiencia de cliente inspiradora, relevante y comercial en cada punto de contacto.<\/li><li>Gestionar las operaciones diarias de la tienda con excelencia, simplicidad y foco en resultados.<\/li><\/ul><p><br><\/p><p><strong>\u00c2\u00bfQu\u00c3\u00a9 buscamos?<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>Experiencia s\u00c3\u00b3lida liderando equipos en retail de moda.<\/li><li>Pasi\u00c3\u00b3n por la moda, las tendencias y la comercialidad.<\/li><li>Perfil anal\u00c3\u00adtico, orientado a resultados y al cliente.<\/li><li>Liderazgo cercano, comunicativo y enfocado en el desarrollo de personas.<\/li><li>Afinidad con los valores de una marca global, din\u00c3\u00a1mica y consciente.<\/li><\/ul><p>Ubicaci\u00c3\u00b3n: C.C Sambil Valencia<\/p><br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **WONDROUS** and tag RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ== when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ==). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Valencia, ","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-store-manager-hola-moda-1137206","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-store-manager-hola-moda-1137206"},{"slug":"remote-visual-merchandiser-hola-moda-1137205","id":"1137205","epoch":1787945142,"date":"2026-08-28T19:25:42+00:00","company":"Hola Moda","company_logo":"","position":"Visual Merchandiser","tags":[],"description":"<p><strong>\u00c2\u00a1Buscamos Visual Merchandiser, para nuestro equipo H&amp;M !<\/strong><\/p><p>Como <strong>Visual Merchandiser<\/strong>, tu misi\u00c3\u00b3n es crear una experiencia de cliente inspiradora y coherente mediante la implementaci\u00c3\u00b3n de est\u00c3\u00a1ndares visuales y comerciales. Eres responsable de la presentaci\u00c3\u00b3n visual, el estilo y la ejecuci\u00c3\u00b3n comercial en la tienda, alineado con las directrices de H&amp;M.<\/p><p><strong>\u00c2\u00bfComo lo haces?<\/strong><\/p><p><strong>Ventas y Experiencia del Cliente<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>Garantizar la curaci\u00c3\u00b3n visual y comercial seg\u00c3\u00ban las pautas.<\/li><li>Representar positivamente la marca H&amp;M.<\/li><li>Ejecutar activaciones globales y actividades de venta.<\/li><li>Monitorear KPIs y proponer acciones para mejorar ventas y experiencia del cliente.<\/li><\/ul><p><strong>Moda y Tendencias<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>Mantenerse actualizado con tendencias, marcas y competidores.<\/li><li>Aplicar teor\u00c3\u00ada de tendencias y t\u00c3\u00a9cnicas de estilo para anticipar necesidades del cliente.<\/li><\/ul><p><strong>Desarrollo de Equipo<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>Capacitar y desarrollar habilidades visuales y comerciales del equipo.<\/li><li>Apoyar en la incorporaci\u00c3\u00b3n de nuevos colegas.<\/li><li>Compartir conocimientos sobre moda, precios y comunicaci\u00c3\u00b3n visual.<\/li><\/ul><p><strong>Ejecuci\u00c3\u00b3n Visual y Comercia<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>Implementar configuraciones de escaparates y estilos.<\/li><li>Asegurar el flujo del cliente y la correcta se\u00c3\u00b1alizaci\u00c3\u00b3n de precios.<\/li><li>Mantener materiales visuales y de exhibici\u00c3\u00b3n en buen estado.<\/li><li>Colaborar con el equipo de instalaciones para una iluminaci\u00c3\u00b3n adecuada.<\/li><\/ul><p><br><\/p><p><strong>Requisitos<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>Estudios en dise\u00c3\u00b1o de modas, dise\u00c3\u00b1o de interiores o afines.<\/li><li>Experiencia previa como visual merchandiser en tiendas de retail.<\/li><li>Conocimiento en tendencias.<\/li><li>Disponibilidad para trabajar en horarios rotativos de centro comercial.<\/li><li>Comunicaci\u00c3\u00b3n asertiva, creatividad y trabajo en equipo.<\/li><\/ul><p><br><\/p><br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **PEPPED** and tag RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ== when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ==). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Valencia, ","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-visual-merchandiser-hola-moda-1137205","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-visual-merchandiser-hola-moda-1137205"},{"slug":"remote-building-maintenance-technician-dart-1137212","id":"1137212","epoch":1787942764,"date":"2026-08-28T18:46:04+00:00","company":"Dart","company_logo":"","position":"Building Maintenance Technician","tags":["sys admin","education","technical","customer support","marketing","travel","medical","engineer","full time"],"description":"<p><strong>JOB TITLE:<\/strong> Building Maintenance Technician<\/p><p><br><\/p><p><strong>SALARY:<\/strong> CI$50,000 - CI$70,000 pa<\/p><p><br><\/p><p><strong>WORKING HOURS: <\/strong>40 HOURS PER WEEK<\/p><p><br><\/p><p><strong>TERM OF EMPLOYMENT<\/strong>: Full-Time<\/p><p><br><\/p><p>We are seeking a Building Maintenance Technician to join our team. The successful candidate will be responsible for the inspection, maintenance, troubleshooting, and repair of building infrastructure and systems to ensure safe, reliable, and efficient operation of facilities.<\/p><p><br><\/p><p><strong>DO YOU HAVE:<\/strong><\/p><p><br><\/p><p>A high school diploma (or equivalent) and a valid trade license<\/p><p>A minimum of 5 years\u00e2\u0080\u0099 experience in building maintenance within Class A Commercial properties<\/p><p>Strong HVAC experience in chilled water and DX systems<\/p><p>Training and certification in electrical, plumbing, HVAC systems maintenance, Pool Operator and Man Lift operation<\/p><p>A valid Cayman Islands driver\u00e2\u0080\u0099s license<\/p><p>The ability to operate hand and power tools required, in a safe and efficient manner<\/p><p>Strong knowledge of building, electrical, plumbing and MEP systems, including related equipment, tools, hazards and safety precautions<\/p><p>Strong communication, problem-solving, and troubleshooting skills<\/p><p>The ability to perform physically demanding manual work for extended periods in varying and sometimes adverse conditions is required, including working in inclement weather and with regular exposure to dust and noise, as well as heavy lifting, prolonged standing, and climbing<\/p><p>The willingness to travel between sites, work at heights, and work outside regular business hours as required<\/p><p>The ability to read and interpret schematic drawings and blueprints (preferred)<\/p><p>A commitment to safety, continuous improvement, and professional development<\/p><p><br><\/p><p><strong>WE WANT YOU TO:<\/strong><\/p><p><br><\/p><p>Inspect, maintain, troubleshoot, and repair mechanical, electrical, plumbing, fire life safety, and other building systems<\/p><p>Diagnose faults using schematic drawings, manuals, and blueprints, and complete corrective maintenance efficiently<\/p><p>Assess faulty equipment, determine repair or replacement needs, review manufacturer specifications and technical documentation, and source the required parts or materials<\/p><p>Adhere to the DE Engineering Health and Safety Manual and maintain accurate maintenance records<\/p><p>Respond to corrective maintenance requests and urgent faults, diagnosing root causes and completing repairs effectively<\/p><p>Inspect and maintain building exteriors, residential units, appliances, fixtures, pools, and site features<\/p><p>Inspect, operate, maintain, and repair HVAC, solar systems, lighting, and related building systems while identifying performance issues and implementing system upgrades as required<\/p><p>Support contractor coordination, disaster preparedness, and recovery activities<\/p><p>Communicate effectively, work collaboratively, promote a safe customer-focused environment, and demonstrate professionalism and sound judgment<\/p><p><br><\/p><p><strong>Compensation &amp; Benefits<\/strong><\/p><p><br><\/p><p>At Dart, we're committed to creating a workplace where you thrive, offering a competitive salary and benefits designed for your well-being and growth. Our package includes 100% employer-paid medical insurance premium for the employee, employee and employer pension contributions, life insurance and long-term disability coverage (conditions apply), enhanced leave options including vacation, personal days, maternity, paternity, a wellness screening day and continuing professional development opportunities after successful completion of a six-month probationary period.<\/p><p><br><\/p><p><strong>DEADLINE:<\/strong> Midnight, Friday 18 September 2026.<\/p><p><br><\/p><br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **TERRIFIC** and tag RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ== when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ==). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"George Town, ","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-building-maintenance-technician-dart-1137212","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-building-maintenance-technician-dart-1137212"},{"slug":"remote-test-digest-media-1137198","id":"1137198","epoch":1787939963,"date":"2026-08-28T17:59:23+00:00","company":"Digest Media","company_logo":"","position":"Test","tags":["design","consulting","exec","ops","engineer","digital nomad","testing"],"description":"\u00e2\u0086\u0090 Back to all jobs<br><br>Newcastle Digest Jobs<br><br>Test<br><br>T<br><br>Test Co<br><br>Posted today<br><br>NewcastleFull-timeOther<br><br><strong>About The Role<br><br><\/strong>Test desc<br><br>Apply Now<br><br>Posted this role? Email info@newcastledigest.com to update or remove this listing.<br><br>Want this seen by 7,000+ Newcastle locals? Post a featured listing from $99 \u00e2\u0086\u0092<br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **TRIVIALLY** and tag RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ== when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ==). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Newcastle, ","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-test-digest-media-1137198","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-test-digest-media-1137198"},{"slug":"remote-captains-capitanes-copa-airlines-1137271","id":"1137271","epoch":1787933160,"date":"2026-08-28T16:06:00+00:00","company":"Copa Airlines","company_logo":"","position":"Captains Capitanes","tags":["infosec","education","designer","customer support","marketing","dev","exec","ops","legal","sales","medical","recruiter","digital nomad","travel"],"description":"<p>We are seeking B737 Captains who share our commitment to safety and customer service, our Captains are passionate leaders driving results and encouraging a teamwork environment.<\/p><p>This position will be based in Panama.<\/p><p><br><\/p><p><strong>Requirements<\/strong><\/p><p>Airline Transport Pilot (ATP) license<\/p><p>Medical Certificate: current unrestricted First-Class<\/p><p>5,000 hours minimum of total Flight Time<\/p><p>1,000 hours of Flight Time as PIC*<\/p><p>Level 5 ICAO English Language Proficiency<\/p><p><br><\/p><p><strong>Benefits<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>We offer a competitive compensation package, health insurance and travel benefits for employees and their families.<\/li><\/ul><br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **EXCITING** and tag RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ== when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ==). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Panam\u00c3\u00a1, ","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-captains-capitanes-copa-airlines-1137271","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-captains-capitanes-copa-airlines-1137271"},{"slug":"remote-sales-manager-radisson-hotel-group-1137200","id":"1137200","epoch":1787921080,"date":"2026-08-28T12:44:40+00:00","company":"Radisson Hotel Group","company_logo":"","position":"Sales Manager","tags":["technical","marketing","excel","sales","engineer","recruiter","full time","exec","customer support","golang"],"description":"<p>Radisson Hotel Group is one of the world's largest hotel groups with ten distinctive hotel brands, and more than 1,500 hotels in operation and under development in 95+ countries. The Group\u00e2\u0080\u0099s overarching brand promise is Every Moment Matters with a signature Yes I Can! service ethos.<br><br><br><br>People are at the core of our business success and future. Our people are true Moment Makers and together we bring the culture, spirit, environment and opportunities that empower you to be your best, every day, everywhere, every time. Together, we make Every Moment Matter.<br><br><br><br><\/p><strong>Job Description<br><br><\/strong><p>Ambitious, thirsty for results, love interacting with people? We are looking for a natural brand promoter just like you! <br><br><\/p><p>Our people are at the core of our success. Your role guarantees variety and excitement every day. At RHG, we cherish your entrepreneurial spirit, collaborative nature. We foster an inclusive and supportive culture where, together, we ensure that every moment is truly meaningful. Embrace your uniqueness as an individual in our team and explore the exciting growth opportunities we have for you and the chance to create memorable moments.<br><br><\/p><p>We are currently seeking a <strong>Sales Manager<\/strong> to join our vibrant team. At RHG, we are in search of individuals who go beyond the resume \u00e2\u0080\u0093 those with character, skills, talents, and a passion for creating memorable experiences. We value mindset as pivotal: anticipating guest needs, supporting your department, and consistently delivering memorable experiences.<br><br><\/p><p>We are dedicated to nurturing and growing talent, offering pathways for advancement, and fostering a culture of continuous learning.<br><br><\/p><p>As the <strong>Sales Manager<\/strong>, you infuse our dynamic Sales Team with an unparalleled level of strategic vision, a results-driven mindset, and an unwavering passion for elevating customer interactions. Your role as a leader is pivotal in steering our sales efforts to new heights, and your ambition sets the tone for achieving exceptional outcomes.<br><br><\/p><ul><li>Manages all aspects of the hotel\u00e2\u0080\u0099s sales team initiatives. <\/li><li>Maximize the revenue and growth of the hotel by directing the revenue generates activities in accordance with the business plan. <\/li><li>Drive new business for your hotel. <\/li><li>Build effective and collaborative relationships with internal and external stakeholders to ensure all sales opportunities are maximized. <br><br><\/li><\/ul><strong>Qualifications<br><br><\/strong><ul><li>Achieve sales goals by managing the sales team. <\/li><li>A proven track record in a similar role within a quality environment and to be able to demonstrate excellent standards and sales productivity. <\/li><li>Commercially astute, multi-tasker who is motivated by challenge. <\/li><li>Driven and ambitious to increase productivity and sales volume with appropriate techniques. <\/li><li>Clear thinker with excellent communication abilities and attention to detail <\/li><li>Strong negotiation skills. <\/li><li>Ability to enhance the hotels community image. <\/li><li>It\u00e2\u0080\u0099s all about the experience and the sale, so say Yes I Can! <br><br><\/li><\/ul><strong>Additional Information<br><br><\/strong><p><strong>Why Join Radisson Hotel Group?<br><br><\/strong><\/p><p><strong>Live the Magic of Hospitality - <\/strong>Be part of a team that creates <strong>exceptional experiences and memorable moments<\/strong> every day. Let your <strong>Yes I Can!<\/strong> spirit shine as you bring hospitality to life. <br><br><\/p><p><strong>Build a Great Career - <\/strong>No matter your background or experience, we invest in your <strong>growth, learning, and career development<\/strong>\u00e2\u0080\u0094helping you reach your full potential. <br><br><\/p><p><strong>Experience the Team Spirit - <\/strong>Join a workplace that\u00e2\u0080\u0099s <strong>inclusive, fun, and meaningful<\/strong>. We celebrate diversity, support one another and foster a sense of belonging through our <strong>Employee Resource Groups and inclusion initiatives<\/strong>.<br><br><\/p><p><strong>Lead with Your Ambition - <\/strong>Your ideas, passion and drive matter! We empower you to <strong>make a difference<\/strong>\u00e2\u0080\u0094in hospitality, your community and beyond. <br><br><\/p><p><strong>Enjoy Global &amp; Local Perks - <\/strong>No matter where you\u00e2\u0080\u0099re located, you\u00e2\u0080\u0099ll enjoy exclusive global benefits - like special hotel rates for you and your loved ones at our hotels worldwide. Plus, you\u00e2\u0080\u0099ll have access to local perks and rewards tailored to your country, making your experience even more rewarding! <br><br><\/p><p><strong>Enjoy benefits such as<\/strong> - up to 53% off your stay as a Team Member at over 1,500 Radisson Hotels worldwide<br><br>Guaranteed minimum of 30% off for your Friends &amp; Family<br><br>Exclusive Discounts on Breakfast, Food &amp; Beverage, Spa and more<br><br><\/p><p><strong>Join us in shaping the future of hospitality!<\/strong> If you\u00e2\u0080\u0099re ready to <strong>bring your talent, energy, and passion<\/strong>, we\u00e2\u0080\u0099d love to hear from you.  <br><br><\/p><p><strong>Apply now and let\u00e2\u0080\u0099s make every moment matter.<\/strong>  <br><br><\/p><p>We welcome applicants from all <strong>backgrounds, abilities, and experiences<\/strong>. If you need any adjustments during the application process, please let us know.<br><br><\/p><br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **INTRIGUINGLY** and tag RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ== when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ==). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Visakhapatnam Rural mandal, ","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-sales-manager-radisson-hotel-group-1137200","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-sales-manager-radisson-hotel-group-1137200"},{"slug":"remote-courier-fedex-1137195","id":"1137195","epoch":1787919459,"date":"2026-08-28T12:17:39+00:00","company":"FedEx","company_logo":"","position":"courier","tags":["infosec","testing","exec","math","content writing","sales"],"description":"To provide courteous and efficient delivery, sorting, and pick-up of packages and ensure shipment of packages by completing all necessary paperwork and checking shipments for conformance to FedEx Express features of service._x000D_<br><br>_x000D_<br><br>Accomplishes accurate and timely pick-up, selection, inspection, and delivery of assigned packages. Seeks additional business from current customers, passes leads to Station Ops manager or Sales person. Informs Sales person and his direct manager of changes in customer use\/competitor\u00e2\u0080\u0099s actions. Checks packages to ensure proper labeling, legality of content including weight and size, proper wrapping, insurance values, special requirements for hazardous material shipment, and compliance with Customs documentations required at destination. Provides necessary paperwork relating to the pick-up and delivery of packages, such as airway bills, delivery records, vehicle conditions, Duties\/Taxes invoices with neatness and accuracy. Ensures proper security of FedEx Express and customer property such as cash, packages, equipment, and hazardous materials. Ensures his\/her own personal safety and security at all times by following FedEx Safety policies and procedures. Operates vehicle safely and efficiently, complying with specific country regulations and corporate policies. Strives for improved productivity through constructive suggestions for better methods, procedures, etc. Collects D\/T invoices from delivered shipments that must be processed by Customs Authorities (when necessary). Ensures customers have adequate supply of FedEx Express material for shipping. Maintains neat and clean appearance of self and uniform and company assigned vehicle.<br><br>High School degree\/Equivalent. Must possess appropriate license for vehicle assigned in accordance with specific country regulations. Good driving record. Neat and clean cut appearance. Good verbal and writing communication skills, human relations, and team player. Must be 21 years old or over. Must be able to successfully complete Reading, Map Reading, Sorting, and math sections of the Basic Skills Test. Ability to lift 70 lbs. (32kgs) and to maneuver and single package weighing up to 150 lbs. (68kgs) with appropriate equipment. Customer orientated with good organizational skills. Must be able to work variable shifts. Basic English skills preferred.<br><br>FedEx is widely acknowledged as a world-class company. We are honored and proud to be consistently recognized as a great place to work, a technology innovator and one of the world\u00e2\u0080\u0099s most admired and respected companies.<br><br>FedEx is consistently named among the World\u00e2\u0080\u0099s most valuable and admired brands. Some of our recent awards include:<br><br><ul><li>2020 Fortune\u00e2\u0080\u0099s World Most Admired Companies (14th)<\/li><li>2019 Fortune\u00e2\u0080\u0099s Best Places to Work (15th)<\/li><li>2019 Forbes\u00e2\u0080\u0099s One of the \u00e2\u0080\u009cBest Employers for Diversity\u00e2\u0080\u009d<\/li><li>2020 FedEx LAC included in the GPTW\u00e2\u0080\u0099s Best Workplaces in Latin America Ranking (24th)<\/li><li>2021 FedEx Mexico was included in the GPTW Ranking for 18th consecutive years<\/li><li>2020 FedEx Mexico received the CEMEFI Certification for 13th consecutive years endorsing FedEx as a company socially responsible<\/li><li>2021 FedEx Chile was re-certified with Giro Limpio, a seal from the Agency of Sustainable Energy that seeks to improve the energy efficiency of the ground transportation sector, by reducing fuel consumption and greenhouse gas emissions.<\/li><li>2019 FedEx Uruguay selected by GPTW among the 5 best companies to work for.<\/li><\/ul><br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **MONUMENTALLY** and tag RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ== when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ==). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Pembroke, ","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-courier-fedex-1137195","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-courier-fedex-1137195"},{"slug":"remote-handyman-woman-royal-lepage-icon-realty-1137196","id":"1137196","epoch":1787916584,"date":"2026-08-28T11:29:44+00:00","company":"Royal Lepage Icon Realty","company_logo":"","position":"handyman woman","tags":["finance","education","medical","non tech"],"description":"<strong>Overview<br><br><\/strong>Languages<br><br>English<br><br>Education<br><br><ul><li> No degree, certificate or diploma <br><br><\/li><\/ul><strong>Experience<br><br><\/strong>Experience an asset<br><br>On site<br><br>Work must be completed at the physical location. There is no option to work remotely.<br><br><strong>Benefits<br><br><\/strong>Health benefits<br><br><ul><li> Dental plan <\/li><li> Health care plan <\/li><li> Vision care benefits <br><br><\/li><\/ul>Financial benefits<br><br><ul><li> Life insurance <\/li><li> Mileage paid<\/li><\/ul><br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **BOUNTIFUL** and tag RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ== when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ==). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Prince Albert, ","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-handyman-woman-royal-lepage-icon-realty-1137196","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-handyman-woman-royal-lepage-icon-realty-1137196"},{"slug":"","id":"1137202","epoch":1787915217,"date":"2026-08-28T11:06:57+00:00","company":"Stanley Black &amp; Decker, Inc.","company_logo":"","position":"\u00e5\u008c\u0096\u00e6\u008c","tags":["marketing","non tech"],"description":"\u00e4\u00bd\u009c\u00e4\u00b8\u009a\u00e4\u00b8\u00ad<br><br><strong><em>We Don\u00e2\u0080\u0099t Just Build The World, We Build Innovative Technology Too.<br><br><\/em><\/strong>Joining the Stanley Black &amp; Decker team means working in an innovative, tech-driven and highly collaborative team environment supported by over 43,500 professionals in 60 countries across the globe. Here, you\u00e2\u0080\u0099ll get the unique chance to impact some of the world\u00e2\u0080\u0099s most iconic brands including STANLEY TOOLS, DEWALT, CRAFTSMAN, MAC TOOLS and Black + Decker. Your ideas and solutions have the potential to reach millions of customers as we work together to write the next chapter in our history. Come build with us and take your career to new heights.<br><br><strong>Who We Are<br><\/strong>We\u00e2\u0080\u0099re the World\u00e2\u0080\u0099s largest tool company. We\u00e2\u0080\u0099re industry visionaries. We\u00e2\u0080\u0099re solving problems and advancing the manufacturing trade through innovative technology and our Industry 4.0 Initiative. We are committed to ensuring our state-of-the-art \u00e2\u0080\u009csmart factory\u00e2\u0080\u009d products and services provide greater quality to our customers &amp; greater environmental and social value to our planet. We are unique in that we have a rich and storied history dating back to 1843, but that hasn't stopped us from evolving into a vibrant, diverse, global growth company.<br><br><strong>Global Benefits &amp; Perks<br><\/strong>You\u00e2\u0080\u0099ll be rewarded with a competitive salary plus receive entitlements and benefits unique to your country of hire.<br><br><strong>What You\u00e2\u0080\u0099ll Also Get<br><\/strong>Career Opportunity: Career paths aren\u00e2\u0080\u0099t linear here. Being part of our global company with 60+ brands gives you the chance to grow and develop your skills along multiple career paths.<br><br><strong>Learning &amp; Development: <br><br><\/strong>Our lifelong learning philosophy means you\u00e2\u0080\u0099ll have access to a wealth of state-of-the-art learning resources, including our Lean Academy and online university (where you can get certificates and specializations from renowned colleges and universities).<br><br><strong>Diverse &amp; Inclusive Culture:<br><br><\/strong>We pride ourselves on being an awesome place to work. We respect and embrace differences because that\u00e2\u0080\u0099s how the best work gets done. You\u00e2\u0080\u0099ll find we like to have fun here, too.<br><br><strong>Purpose-Driven Company:<br><br><\/strong>You\u00e2\u0080\u0099ll help us continue to make positive changes in the local communities where we work and live as well as in the broader world through volunteerism, giving back and sustainable business practices.<br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **REFORM** and tag RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ== when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ==). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"\u00e4\u00b8\u00ad\u00e5\u00b1\u00b1\u00e5\u00b8\u0082, ","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/"},{"slug":"remote-dont-see-your-role-apply-here-atreides-1137186","id":"1137186","epoch":1787887671,"date":"2026-08-28T03:27:51+00:00","company":"Atreides","company_logo":"","position":"Don\u00e2\u0080\u0099t see your role Apply here","tags":["travel","exec","ops","medical"],"description":"<strong><strong>Not seeing a position that matches your skillset? Kindly submit your resume to be considered for future opportunities.<br><br><\/strong><\/strong><strong><strong>Company Overview:<\/strong><\/strong> Atreides helps organizations transform large and complex multi-modal datasets into information-rich geospatial data subscriptions that can be used across a wide spectrum of use cases. Currently, Atreides focuses on providing high-fidelity data solutions to enable customers to derive insights quickly.\u00e2\u0080\u00af<br><br>We are a fast-moving, high-performance startup. We value a diverse team and believe inclusion drives better performance. We trust our team with autonomy, believing it leads to better results and job satisfaction. With a mission-driven mindset and entrepreneurial spirit, we are building something new and helping unlock the power of massive-scale data to make the world safer, stronger, and more prosperous.<br><br><strong><strong>Team Overview:<\/strong><\/strong> We are a passionate team of technologists, data scientists, and analysts with backgrounds in operational intelligence, law enforcement, large multinationals, and cybersecurity operations.\u00e2\u0080\u00af We obsess about designing products that will change the way global companies, governments and non-profits protect themselves from external threats and global adversaries.\u00e2\u0080\u00af<br><br><strong>Team Principles<br><br><\/strong>At Atreides, we believe that teams work best when they:<br><br><ul><li>Remain curious and passionate in all aspects of our work <\/li><li>Promote clear, direct, and transparent communication <\/li><li>Embrace the 'measure twice, cut once' philosophy <\/li><li>Value and encourage diverse ideas and technologies <\/li><li>Lead with empathy in all interactions <br><br><\/li><\/ul><strong>Compensation And Benefits<br><br><\/strong><ul><li>Competitive salary\u00e2\u0080\u00af <\/li><li>Comprehensive health, dental, and vision insurance plans <\/li><li>Flexible remote or hybrid work environment <\/li><li>Additional benefits like flexible hours, work travel opportunities, competitive vacation time and parental leave<\/li><\/ul><br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **CAPABILITY** and tag RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ== when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ==). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Denmark, Denmark, Western Australia, Australia","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-dont-see-your-role-apply-here-atreides-1137186","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-dont-see-your-role-apply-here-atreides-1137186"},{"slug":"remote-english-teacher-pembroke-school-1137182","id":"1137182","epoch":1787881985,"date":"2026-08-28T01:53:05+00:00","company":"Pembroke School","company_logo":"","position":"English Teacher","tags":["exec","sys admin","customer support","marketing","c","microsoft","ops","excel","sales","english teacher","teaching","design","education","senior","recruiter","full time","digital nomad"],"description":"<ul><li>Full-time, ongoing<\/li><li>Commencing Term 1, 2027<\/li><li>Salary commensurate with years of Service<\/li><li>Continuous professional development opportunities<\/li><li>Generous staff benefits<\/li><\/ul><p><br><\/p><p>English at Pembroke is taught by a large, dynamic team across Years 7 to 12, spanning both SACE and the International Baccalaureate. Our Middle School curriculum has been recently redesigned around conceptual threads and a portfolio-based approach to assessment that prioritises the process of learning, not just its products. Our teachers enjoy considerable freedom in text selection, within a framework of high academic expectations, and our faculty culture is one of collegiality, intellectual curiosity and serious engagement with pedagogy. Our staff contribute to curriculum design, and are supported to grow as practitioners at every career stage.<\/p><p><br><\/p><p><strong>About the Role<\/strong><\/p><p>Successful applicants will teach across the secondary years, with allocations shaped by experience and strengths. Depending on the appointment, this may include Middle School classes, senior SACE English subjects, or IB Diploma Language A courses.<\/p><p><br><\/p><p><em>Key Responsibilities include:<\/em><\/p><ul><li>Delivering engaging, rigorous and innovative English lessons that foster a love of learning<\/li><li>Supporting students to develop strong literacy, analytical and communication skills<\/li><li>Providing purposeful assessment and feedback that supports every students' growth<\/li><li>Contributing to a positive and collaborative culture across the Middle and Senior Schools<\/li><li>Actively participating in the life of the School through co-curricular and pastoral care contributions.<\/li><\/ul><p><br><\/p><p><strong>About You<\/strong><\/p><p>You are an effective teacher first and foremost, with demonstrated impact on student learning and a command of your subject that lets you teach with both rigour and imagination.<\/p><p><br><\/p><p><em>You will bring:<\/em><\/p><ul><li>Strong subject knowledge and a love of literature and language that students can feel<\/li><li>Evidence-informed, responsive pedagogy and high expectations of every learner<\/li><li>Capacity or willingness to teach across SACE and IB pathways (IB experience is valued but not required; training and support are provided)<\/li><li>Strong communication with students, families and colleagues<\/li><li>A collaborative disposition and a genuine interest in contributing to faculty and school life<\/li><\/ul><p><br><\/p><p><strong>Applications at All Career Stages<\/strong><\/p><p>We welcome applications from experienced practitioners and from graduate and early-career teachers alike. Early-career appointees are supported through structured mentoring and induction as part of a faculty that takes professional growth seriously.<\/p><p><br><\/p><p><strong>Required for Employment (Prior to Commencement)<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>Current Working with Children Check (South Australia)<\/li><li>Current Plink RRHAN-EC training: Masterclass and Fundamentals, including Protective Practices<\/li><li>First Aid and CPR<\/li><\/ul><p><br><\/p><p><strong>Find Your Place At Pembroke<\/strong><\/p><p>At Pembroke, you\u00e2\u0080\u0099ll be part of a warm and collaborative school community that values relationships, initiative, and a shared commitment to learning. Whether in the classroom, on the sporting field, or behind the scenes, every role contributes to shaping the rich and inclusive culture of the School. With opportunities for professional growth, a strong sense of belonging, and a genuine appreciation for staff, Pembroke is a place where your work is seen, valued, and celebrated.<\/p><p><br><\/p><p>Read more in <em>The Heart of Pembroke - Celebrating our Staff<\/em>.<\/p><p><br><\/p><p>Pembroke School is a co-educational, non-denominational, day and boarding School from Early Learning Centre to Year 12. Renowned for academic excellence and a broad, inclusive program, Pembroke offers the South Australian Certificate of Education (SACE) and is also an International Baccalaureate World School, offering the IB Diploma Programme (IBDP) and Primary Years Programme (PYP).<\/p><p><br><\/p><p>Pembroke is a vibrant and exciting School catering for a diverse community of students. With over 1,700 students, the School offers a broad-ranging curriculum and an outstanding choice of co-curricular opportunities. The School employs over 300 permanent and fixed-term staff, plus more than 150 casual employees.<\/p><p><br><\/p><p>Pembroke seeks to engage outstanding, diverse and well-qualified staff to work in our welcoming and open School. All staff work together to provide an environment that facilitates each student\u00e2\u0080\u0099s exploration of their potential, academic progress and personal welfare. Staff are encouraged to maintain a collaborative approach, a broad outlook within their respective field and a commitment to ongoing professional development and continuous improvement. Pembroke is a lively and fulfilling place to work.<\/p><p><br><\/p><p><strong>How to Apply<\/strong><\/p><p>Applications for this position close on Sunday, 6 September 2026, at 11:59 pm.<\/p><p><br><\/p><ul><li>You are required to upload a CV and a cover letter (maximum 2 pages) identifying your interest in applying and what you could bring to the role.<\/li><li>Your application should be addressed to the Acting Principal, Mr Chris Zielinski.<\/li><li>The School reserves the right to shortlist and interview candidates before the closing date. Early applications are strongly encouraged.<\/li><li>For any enquiries regarding this position, please email talent@pembroke.sa.edu.au<\/li><li>Please do not email your applications.<\/li><li>Late applications and those submitted via external recruitment agencies will not be considered.<\/li><\/ul><p><br><\/p><p><strong><em>Pembroke School is an equal opportunity employer.<\/em><\/strong><\/p><br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **CAPTIVATE** and tag RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ== when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ==). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Adelaide, ","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-english-teacher-pembroke-school-1137182","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-english-teacher-pembroke-school-1137182"},{"slug":"remote-car-wash-attendant-hertz-1137276","id":"1137276","epoch":1787880728,"date":"2026-08-28T01:32:08+00:00","company":"Hertz","company_logo":"","position":"Car Wash Attendant","tags":["education","customer support","recruiter","non tech","hr","marketing","travel"],"description":"<strong>Job Description<br><br><\/strong>Wage: $17.60\/hr<br><br>We are looking for a Full Time Car Wash Attendant who takes pride in their work and drives customer satisfaction. If this is you, and you\u00e2\u0080\u0099re ready for your next destination, then you have cruised to the right spot!<br><br><strong>Benefits And Perks<br><br><\/strong>Not only do you get to be part of an organization where you Drive your Potential, Power your Passion!! Below are a few perks and discounts:<br><br><ul><li>Up to 40% off the base rate of any standard Hertz rental<\/li><li>Discounted Travel, gym membership and Food <\/li><li>Career Growth with hands-on learning<\/li><li>Medical, Dental &amp; Vision plan options<\/li><li>Retirement programs, including voluntary pension plan with employer matching<\/li><li>Employee Assistance Program for employees &amp; family<\/li><li>Educational Reimbursement &amp; Discounts <br><br><\/li><\/ul><strong>Job Description<br><br><\/strong>The Full Time Car Wash Attendant is responsible to ensure a vehicle is ready for customer pick-up. Drive and park cars on the lot as needed. Check the vehicles for damage. Fill gasoline and check all fluid levels. Meet processing and standardization quotas. In this role you will be required to work outdoors in all weather conditions.<br><br><strong>Qualifications<br><br><\/strong>High School diploma or equivalent required. Must be 20 years of age or older. A valid driver\u00e2\u0080\u0099s license is required with a clean driver record. Must be able to work on your feet for majority of your shift. Must be able to work in all weather conditions.<br><br>We use AI\u00e2\u0080\u0091enabled tools to screen and\/or assess applications against job\u00e2\u0080\u0091related criteria (e.g., minimum qualifications and keywords). All hiring decisions involve human review.<br><br>#zip<br><br><strong>About Us<br><br><\/strong>The Hertz Corporation operates the Hertz, Dollar Car Rental, Thrifty Car Rental brands in approximately 9,700 corporate and franchisee locations throughout North America, Europe, The Caribbean, Latin America, Africa, the Middle East, Asia, Australia and New Zealand. The Hertz Corporation is one of the largest worldwide airport general use vehicle rental companies, and the Hertz brand is one of the most recognized in the world.<br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **EXCELENT** and tag RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ== when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ==). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Etobicoke, ","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-car-wash-attendant-hertz-1137276","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-car-wash-attendant-hertz-1137276"},{"slug":"remote-cdp-hilton-salwa-beach-resort-amp-villas-1137179","id":"1137179","epoch":1787872563,"date":"2026-08-27T23:16:03+00:00","company":"Hilton Salwa Beach Resort &amp; Villas","company_logo":"","position":"Cdp","tags":["testing","non tech"],"description":"-<br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **STRONGEST** and tag RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ== when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ==). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"\u00d9\u0085\u00d8\u00b3\u00d9\u0082\u00d8\u00b7, ","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-cdp-hilton-salwa-beach-resort-amp-villas-1137179","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-cdp-hilton-salwa-beach-resort-amp-villas-1137179"},{"slug":"remote-meat-and-seafood-clerk-petes-frootique-1137191","id":"1137191","epoch":1787872410,"date":"2026-08-27T23:13:30+00:00","company":"Pete's Frootique","company_logo":"","position":"Meat and Seafood Clerk","tags":["supervisor","web dev","exec","customer support","ops"],"description":"Meat &amp; Seafood Clerk<br><br>At Pete's Frootique &amp; Fine Foods, we're passionate about providing our customers with the freshest, highest-quality products and exceptional service. As a Meat &amp; Seafood Clerk, you'll play an important role in creating an outstanding shopping experience by delivering knowledgeable, friendly service and maintaining an inviting, well-stocked department.<br><br>What You'll Do<br><br><ul><li>Provide exceptional customer service by assisting customers with product selection and answering questions.<\/li><li>Slice, cut, weigh, package, label, and price meat and seafood products accurately and efficiently.<\/li><li>Create attractive, fully stocked displays that showcase the quality and freshness of our products.<\/li><li>Ensure all products meet Pete's high standards for food safety, quality, and presentation.<\/li><li>Share product knowledge with customers, including cooking tips and preparation suggestions.<\/li><li>Maintain a clean, organized, and safe work environment.<\/li><li>Support your team with daily department operations and other duties as required.<br><br><\/li><\/ul>What We're Looking For<br><br><ul><li>A positive, enthusiastic attitude and a passion for delivering outstanding customer service.<\/li><li>A genuine interest in quality food and helping customers find the right products.<\/li><li>Strong communication and interpersonal skills.<\/li><li>Excellent attention to detail and the ability to work efficiently in a fast-paced environment.<\/li><li>A willingness to learn new skills and grow within the department.<\/li><li>Ability to prioritize tasks and work collaboratively as part of a team.<\/li><li>Availability to work flexible hours, including evenings and weekends.<br><br><\/li><\/ul>Experience in a meat, seafood, grocery, or food service environment is considered an asset but is not required\u00e2\u0080\u0094we're happy to train the right candidate who shares our passion for great food and exceptional customer service.<br><br>Powered by ExactHire: 206563<br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **EFFUSIVENESS** and tag RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ== when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ==). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Bedford, ","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-meat-and-seafood-clerk-petes-frootique-1137191","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-meat-and-seafood-clerk-petes-frootique-1137191"},{"slug":"remote-receiver-petes-frootique-1137192","id":"1137192","epoch":1787872396,"date":"2026-08-27T23:13:16+00:00","company":"Pete's Frootique","company_logo":"","position":"Receiver","tags":["supervisor","web dev","exec","customer support","ops"],"description":"Our Receiving team plays a vital role in keeping the store running smoothly. This fast-paced position is responsible for receiving, inspecting, and organizing incoming deliveries to ensure our departments are fully stocked with the freshest, highest-quality products.<br><br>As a Receiver, you will accurately verify deliveries for quality and quantity, organize inventory efficiently, and rotate stock to maintain freshness and minimize waste. During slower periods, you will support the Produce Department with a variety of tasks, making you an important part of our overall store team.<br><br>This position requires excellent organizational skills, attention to detail, physical stamina, and a positive, team-oriented attitude. You must be able to lift up to 50 lbs. A valid driver's license may be required, and applicants must meet company insurability requirements where applicable.<br><br><strong>Qualifications<br><br><\/strong><ul><li>Positive, enthusiastic, and dependable attitude.<\/li><li>Passion for food and delivering quality.<\/li><li>Strong organizational skills and attention to detail.<\/li><li>Commitment to providing outstanding customer service.<\/li><li>Ability to work efficiently in a fast-paced environment.<\/li><li>Willingness to learn new skills and take on a variety of responsibilities.<\/li><li>Team player with strong communication skills.<\/li><li>Ability to frequently lift up to 50 lbs.<br><br><\/li><\/ul>Join Our Team<br><br>If you enjoy staying active, take pride in keeping things organized, and want to be part of a team that values quality, teamwork, and exceptional service, we'd love to hear from you. Join Pete's Frootique &amp; Fine Foods and help ensure our customers enjoy the freshest products every day.<br><br><em>This job description is intended to describe the general nature of the position. It is not intended to be an exhaustive list of duties, responsibilities, or qualifications. Additional duties may be assigned as required.<br><br><\/em>Powered by ExactHire: 206573<br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **TRIUMPHANT** and tag RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ== when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ==). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Bedford, ","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-receiver-petes-frootique-1137192","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-receiver-petes-frootique-1137192"},{"slug":"remote-store-manager-crocs-inc-1137181","id":"1137181","epoch":1787865236,"date":"2026-08-27T21:13:56+00:00","company":"Crocs, Inc.","company_logo":"","position":"Store Manager","tags":["exec","sys admin","customer support","marketing","c","microsoft","ops","excel","sales"],"description":"At Crocs, Inc., every career offers a chance to make a real impact. No two journeys look the same. And that's exactly how we like it. Whether you\u00e2\u0080\u0099re welcoming customers into our stores, collaborating with global teams at our headquarters, or keeping operations moving at our distribution centers, your impact is real and valued. At Crocs, Inc. you\u00e2\u0080\u0099re not expected to fit a mold. You\u00e2\u0080\u0099re encouraged to break it and create something better.<br><br><strong>Overview<br><br><\/strong>As the Store Manager, you will lead a dedicated team of store associates &amp; leaders every day, to create an exceptional consumer experience.\u00e2\u0080\u00af Your focus will be on driving sales, providing excellent customer service, maintaining visual presentations, and developing talent within the store. This role offers opportunity to grow and collaborate with industry leading teammates and partners.<br><br><strong><strong>What You'll Do<br><br><\/strong><\/strong><ul><li> Deliver outstanding service to our consumers using our C.H.A.R.M service model <\/li><li> Leads the store team in surpassing performance metrics including sales, consumer service and charms <\/li><li> Apply analytical thinking &amp; company reporting to find opportunities within store, empowering the team to make strategic decisions <\/li><li> Lead visual presentation, product flow, replenishment, and operational standards throughout the store <\/li><li> Foster a welcoming, inclusive environment that engages promotes internal growth and builds an external network of talent <\/li><li> Coordinate, delegate, prioritize and meet store deadlines while ensuring effective follow up on daily activities <\/li><li> Contribute to crafting a team environment that encourages sharing of suggestions, ideas, and concerns while upholding Crocs Inc. values <\/li><li> Learn &amp; assist in various departments including consumer service, product knowledge, visual presentation, and stock room management. <\/li><li> Support team members in the daily execution of retail operations i.e., POS system management and use, stock replenishment, assist in pricing and markdown processes seasonally, promote loyalty programs, maintain cleanliness and recovery standards etc. <\/li><li> Adhere to Crocs, Inc. Asset Protection policies and procedures, including shortage prevention, inventory control, and compliance procedures <br><br><\/li><\/ul><strong><strong>What You'll Bring to the Table<br><br><\/strong><\/strong><ul><li> Minimum 18+ years old <\/li><li> Possess at least A Level \/ SSCE\/ Diploma \/ Advanced Diploma or above preferred <\/li><li> Minimum 5 years of total retail experience; preferably with previous Store Manager experience. <\/li><li> Demonstrated leadership abilities, with a passion for challenging, empowering, and driving team results <\/li><li> Professional working proficiency in English, proficiency of other language(s) will be an advantage <\/li><li> Proven communication skills (written and verbal) to successfully connect with store team, operations managers, District Managers &amp; corporate partners <\/li><li> Flexible to work on rotational shift basis, including nights, Saturdays, Sundays and Public Holidays. <\/li><li> Intermediate computer proficiency in Microsoft Word, PowerPoint, Excel and Email and able to operate retail Point of Sale system <\/li><li> Demonstrated leadership abilities, with a passion for challenging, empowering, and driving team results <\/li><li> Desire to succeed in a high growth, fast-paced retail environment <\/li><li> The work environment and physical demands described here are representative of but not limited to those that an employee will encounter while performing the essential functions of this job. <\/li><li> Ability to climb and descend ladders carrying merchandise daily <\/li><li> Ability to lift 15kg or more with assistance daily <br><br><\/li><\/ul>The Company is an Equal Opportunity Employer committed to a diverse and inclusive work environment.\u00e2\u0080\u00afThis posting is for an existing vacany and we accept applications on an ongoing basis.<br><br>All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, or disability, or any other classification protected by law.<br><br>Title: Store Manager<br><br>The posted pay range reflects geographic market conditions and may vary by location. Compensation will always meet or exceed applicable local minimum wage requirements.<br><br>This position is eligible to participate in a company incentive program.<br><br>This position is eligible for company benefits including but not limited to medical, dental, and vision coverage, life and AD&amp;D, short and long-term disability coverage, paid time off, employee assistance, and many other additional voluntary benefits. This organization participates in E-Verify<br><br>Job Category: Retail<br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **ACCOMODATIVE** and tag RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ== when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ==). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Chatswood, ","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-store-manager-crocs-inc-1137181","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-store-manager-crocs-inc-1137181"},{"slug":"remote-vehicle-progressor-vertu-motors-plc-1137176","id":"1137176","epoch":1787849379,"date":"2026-08-27T16:49:39+00:00","company":"Vertu Motors plc","company_logo":"","position":"Vehicle Progressor","tags":["exec","hr","education","game dev","customer support","dev","marketing","finance","flutter","medical","digital nomad","scheme","sales"],"description":"<strong>Vertu Hyundai Dunfermline<br><br><\/strong>We are currently looking for a Vehicle Progressor to come and join our fantastic team at Vertu Hyundai Dunfermline.<br><br>We are offering a Basic Salary of \u00c2\u00a328,000 plus excellent Company Benefits.<br><br>It is the responsibility of the Vehicle Progressor to ensure that every vehicle is prepared to meet group standard within 72hrs of arrival.<br><br>This includes initial cosmetic inspections when booking vehicles in, organising all aspects of cosmetic work to be completed from wheel refurbishment, painting, trim repairs, valeting and photographs of all vehicles ready for sale along with assist the sales manager in writing the verbatim comments.<br><br>This role is also responsible for quality checking the condition of all vehicles once vehicle preparation has been completed and the logistics for the vehicles being returned to the required dealerships , organising vehicles for preparation for sale.<br><br>Experience is not essential to be considered for this role as full training will be provided.<br><br>You must be a driven and motivated, yet disciplined, individual who is able to communicate well with customers and be able to work as an individual and part of a team . Your passion, energy and commitment must be second to none and should be able to be demonstrated at interview. You will have a keen eye for detail and be confident using technology.<br><br>Applicants must also hold a full UK driving licence as collection and delivery of vehicles to customers maybe required.<br><br><strong>Benefits<br><br><\/strong>We are proud to be the Motor Retailer who invests more in our colleague's personal development than any other, so if you are successful, you can look forward to on-going training opportunities that provide you with the right career path, career progression and a range of benefits you would expect from an employer of choice which includes:<br><br><ul><li>25 days holiday rising with length of service - plus bank holidays<\/li><li>Access to our online rewards platform giving you cash back and discounts for multiple retailers<\/li><li>Preferential Service Rates<\/li><li>Colleague Purchase Scheme<\/li><li>Share Incentive Scheme<\/li><li>Pension<\/li><li>Enhanced Maternity &amp; Paternity<br><br><br><\/li><\/ul>If you are interested in this fantastic opportunity then apply to join today!<br><br>If your application is successful, we will need to complete employment checks prior to you starting with us. For this role, these can include us verifying your recent employment, address and credit history. We may also conduct a criminal record check and a driving licence check.<br><br><br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **MERIT** and tag RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ== when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ==). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Dunfermline, ","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-vehicle-progressor-vertu-motors-plc-1137176","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-vehicle-progressor-vertu-motors-plc-1137176"},{"slug":"remote-programmatic-campaign-operations-specialist-trader-virtuhire-1137169","id":"1137169","epoch":1787846404,"date":"2026-08-27T16:00:04+00:00","company":"VirtuHire","company_logo":"","position":"Programmatic Campaign Operations Specialist Trader","tags":["amazon","technical","customer support","quality assurance","video","exec","senior","ops","excel","full time"],"description":"<p>Location: South Africa \u00e2\u0080\u0093 Remote<br \/> Hours: 14:00\u00e2\u0080\u009323:00 SAST, Monday\u00e2\u0080\u0093Friday, aligned with U.S. Eastern business hours<br \/> Employment: Permanent, Full-Time<\/p>Role Purpose<p>Execute and maintain programmatic campaigns accurately and efficiently within MediaPath's established strategy, workflows, and QA standards. This is a hands-on campaign execution role focused on campaign builds, trafficking, pacing, optimisation, troubleshooting, and maintenance.<\/p>\n<p><\/p>Key Responsibilities<ul><li> Build campaigns, line items, targeting structures, and campaign components within assigned DSPs. <\/li><li> Traffic creative assets and third-party tags. <\/li><li> Complete pre-launch campaign QA. <\/li><li> Monitor campaign pacing and delivery on a daily basis. <\/li><li> Identify and escalate pacing or delivery risks before they become client-visible. <\/li><li> Execute routine optimisations and approved campaign changes within defined guidelines. <\/li><li> Troubleshoot campaign, creative, targeting, and activation issues. <\/li><li> Escalate complex technical issues to the Senior Programmatic Operations Lead. <\/li><li> Maintain accurate campaign documentation, naming conventions, and change histories. <\/li><li> Provide screenshots, compliance documentation, and campaign data when required. <\/li><li> Support campaign closeout, reconciliation, and reporting processes. <\/li><li> Work accurately across high volumes of campaigns and line items. <\/li><\/ul>Must-Have Requirements<ul><li> 2\u00e2\u0080\u00934 years of hands-on digital or programmatic campaign execution experience. <\/li><li> Direct experience building and managing campaigns within at least one major DSP. <\/li><li> Ability to learn and work across additional platforms quickly. <\/li><li> Strong attention to detail. <\/li><li> Comfortable with repetitive, high-volume campaign production where accuracy is critical. <\/li><li> Strong Excel and Google Sheets skills. <\/li><li> Comfortable working from insertion orders, build sheets, and campaign specifications. <\/li><li> Strong written communication. <\/li><li> Disciplined escalation and issue-management skills. <\/li><\/ul>Preferred Experience<p>Experience with one or more of:<\/p><ul><li> DV360 <\/li><li> Basis <\/li><li> Simpli.fi <\/li><li> Amazon DSP <\/li><li> Meta <\/li><li> YouTube <\/li><li> VAST and ad-server tags <\/li><li> PMP deals <\/li><li> Verification tools <\/li><li> CTV\/OTT <\/li><li> Online video <\/li><li> Agency or managed-service campaign operations <\/li><\/ul>Success in the Role<ul><li> Campaigns are built correctly the first time. <\/li><li> Campaigns meet agreed launch SLAs. <\/li><li> Pacing and delivery issues are identified early. <\/li><li> Routine changes are completed quickly and accurately. <\/li><li> Campaign documentation remains clean and up to date. <\/li><li> QA and escalation procedures are consistently followed. <\/li><li> The wider programmatic team can rely on accurate, consistent execution. <\/li><\/ul><br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **GLORIOUS** and tag RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ== when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ==). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-programmatic-campaign-operations-specialist-trader-virtuhire-1137169","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-programmatic-campaign-operations-specialist-trader-virtuhire-1137169"},{"slug":"remote-journeyman-i-p-wood-1137197","id":"1137197","epoch":1787845332,"date":"2026-08-27T15:42:12+00:00","company":"Wood","company_logo":"","position":"Journeyman I P","tags":["design","consulting","exec","ops","engineer","digital nomad"],"description":"<strong>About Us<br><br><\/strong>Wood is a global leader in consulting, engineering and operations for the energy and materials sectors. With 33,000 people in around 50 countries, Wood supports clients across the full asset lifecycle, delivering safe, predictable outcomes while enabling resilient operations and a lower carbon future. Wood forms the Energy &amp; Materials pillar of Sidara - a global partnership uniting leading multidisciplinary engineering, design, and project management companies. www.woodgroup.com<br><br><strong>Diversity Statement <br><br><\/strong>We are an equal opportunity employer that recognises the value of a diverse workforce. All suitably qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment on the basis of objective criteria and without regard to the following (which is a non-exhaustive list): race, colour, age, religion, gender, national origin, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, protected veteran status, or other characteristics in accordance with the relevant governing laws.<br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **GRACEFUL** and tag RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ== when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ==). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Carlsbad, ","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-journeyman-i-p-wood-1137197","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-journeyman-i-p-wood-1137197"},{"slug":"remote-people-director-sisal-hub-albania-1137175","id":"1137175","epoch":1787843288,"date":"2026-08-27T15:08:08+00:00","company":"Sisal Hub Albania","company_logo":"","position":"People Director","tags":["exec","hr","education","game dev","customer support","dev","marketing","finance","flutter","medical","digital nomad"],"description":"<strong>Job Description<br><br><\/strong><strong>About us<br><br><\/strong>Flutter, the world\u00e2\u0080\u0099s largest online sports betting and iGaming group listed on the London and New York stock exchanges, is home to the Southern Europe &amp; Africa (SEA) region, featuring iconic brands like Sisal, Snai and PokerStars, a globally loved brand that embodies innovation and ambition, with significant growth potential in a dynamic market.<br><br><strong>What You\u00e2\u0080\u0099ll Do:<br><br><\/strong><ul><li>Lead the local HR and General Services function as a member of the leadership team, partnering directly with the General Manager on the people priorities that move the business.<\/li><li>Translate Flutter's group people strategy into the Albanian reality, working hand-in-hand with the Corporate HR Competence Centers in Italy.<\/li><li>Own the full HR cycle on the ground: workforce planning and budgeting, talent acquisition, onboarding, learning and development, performance management, compensation, disciplinary matters, labor litigation, union and labor relations, and external partnerships.<\/li><li>Oversee General Services and Health, Safety &amp; Environment (HSE), making sure our people work in a safe, modern, and well-run environment.<\/li><li>Lead and coordinate the Communication team, ensuring internal and external messages reflect who we are and where we're going.<br><br><\/li><\/ul><strong>Who You Are:<br><br><\/strong><ul><li>Experienced professional with several years of experience in international, structured environments, as well as hands-on experience in start-up settings.<\/li><li>A change agent with strong leadership skills and the ability to act as a role model.<\/li><li>Skilled in influencing and building effective relationships.<\/li><li>Hold a degree in Economics or Humanities.<\/li><li>Fluent in both Italian and English.<\/li><li>Proficient in using Human Capital Management software.<\/li><li>Demonstrate a strong ethical approach and professional integrity.<\/li><li>Proactive, flexible, innovative, and determined.<\/li><li>A capable team leader and team player who fosters collaboration and empowers team members.<\/li><li>Act as a coach and mentor for both team members and stakeholders.<\/li><li>Skilled in active listening and committed to supporting and caring for people within the organization.<\/li><li>Experienced HR Business Partner with expertise in managing the full employee lifecycle, from hiring to retirement.<\/li><li>A facilitator, influencer, business partner, and problem solver who supports decision-making processes.<\/li><li>Data-driven with strong analytical capabilities.<br><br><\/li><\/ul><strong>Preferred Qualifications:<br><br><\/strong><ul><li>Previous experience working with Italian companies is an advantage.<br><br><\/li><\/ul><strong>Why choose us:<br><br><\/strong><ul><li>A dynamic environment within the world\u00e2\u0080\u0099s largest online gaming group.<\/li><li>Opportunities for learning, growth and cross-country collaboration.<\/li><li>Meal allowance.<\/li><li>Supplemental Health Insurance.<br><br><\/li><\/ul><strong>Choose us also for:<br><br><\/strong><ul><li>An inclusive work culture and access to our Diversity &amp; Inclusion initiatives.<\/li><li>Well-Being Support: meditation courses, online medical services and counselling with certified coaches and psychologists.<\/li><li>Learning &amp; Development: training platforms, workshops, conferences, and our FlexiLearning program (4 hours per month dedicated to learning).<\/li><li>Parental Leave Packages offering additional financial and practical support.<\/li><li>Volunteering during working hours.<br><br><\/li><\/ul><strong>Much more about us:<br><br><\/strong><ul><li>Have a look at our amazing blog Inside: hear directly from our employees at the following link: Inside.<\/li><li>Reviews and comments from our Glassdoor and Indeed pages. Put yours!<br><br><\/li><\/ul><strong>Equal Opportunity <br><br><\/strong>Flutter SEA is an Equal Opportunity Organization. Diversity and Inclusion are fundamental values for us. We welcome any candidate without distinction of age, culture, religion, ethnicity, sexual orientation, gender identity and expression.<br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **EXCELENT** and tag RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ== when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ==). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Tirana, ","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-people-director-sisal-hub-albania-1137175","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-people-director-sisal-hub-albania-1137175"},{"slug":"remote-health-safety-environment-jai-hanuman-udyog-limited-1137180","id":"1137180","epoch":1787842496,"date":"2026-08-27T14:54:56+00:00","company":"JAI HANUMAN UDYOG LIMITED","company_logo":"","position":"Health Safety Environment","tags":["testing","non tech","medical"],"description":"environment health and safety<br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **STRIKINGLY** and tag RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ== when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ==). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Odisha, ","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-health-safety-environment-jai-hanuman-udyog-limited-1137180","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-health-safety-environment-jai-hanuman-udyog-limited-1137180"},{"slug":"remote-sourcer-private-destinations-royal-caribbean-group-1137172","id":"1137172","epoch":1787839882,"date":"2026-08-27T14:11:22+00:00","company":"Royal Caribbean Group","company_logo":"","position":"Sourcer Private Destinations","tags":["sys admin","sourcer","customer support","dev","exec","ops","marketing","excel","golang","recruiter","digital nomad"],"description":"<strong>Journey with us!<\/strong> Combine your career goals and sense of adventure by joining our incredible team of employees at <strong>Royal Caribbean Group<\/strong>. We are proud to offer a competitive compensation and benefits package, and excellent career development opportunities, each offering unique ways to explore the world.<br><br>We are proud to be the vacation-industry leader with global brands \u00e2\u0080\u0094 including Royal Caribbean International, Celebrity Cruises and Silversea Cruises \u00e2\u0080\u0094 the most innovative fleet and private destinations, and the best people. Together, we are dedicated to turning the vacation of a lifetime into a lifetime of vacations for our guests.<br><br>Royal Caribbean Group\u00e2\u0080\u0099s <strong>Shipboard Recruiting team<\/strong> has an exciting career opportunity for a full time <strong>Sourcer, Private Destinations<\/strong> reporting to the <strong>Director, Shipboard Recruiting<\/strong>.<br><br><strong>This position will reside in Nassau Bahamas and will sit in our main office.<br><br><\/strong><strong>Position Summary<br><br><\/strong>The Sourcer executes all strategic sourcing activities in partnership with the Private Destinations talent acquisition initiatives across entry levels and functions.<br><br>The goal is to ensure that the organization can consistently proactively deploy the right people, in the right place, at the right time, at the most efficient cost, and for them to be fully engaged.<br><br><strong>Essential Duties And Responsibilities<br><br><\/strong><ul><li>Builds and implements sourcing strategy.<\/li><li>Understands and executes current trends and best practices in sourcing and talent attraction.<\/li><li>Builds talent pipelines from various platforms such as social media, job boards, niche sites, and other similar platforms to implement sourcing strategy.<\/li><li>Creates candidate pipeline ahead of need and real time.<\/li><li>Leverages proprietary pipelines of candidates through our ATS and CRM.<\/li><li>Collaborates with recruiters to develop market strategy, pipeline candidates, provide insights, and share competitive intelligence.<\/li><li>Partners with the necessary team(s) to establish, develop, and maintain relationships with hiring managers.<\/li><li>Provides support of inbound sourcing (candidate \/ req management) as needed.<\/li><li>Assists with recruitment marketing and events initiatives.<\/li><li>Help support candidates with applications.<\/li><li>Assists with overseeing Smartsheet trackers.<\/li><li>Meets operational business goals and KPI\u00e2\u0080\u0099s.<br><br><\/li><\/ul><strong>Qualifications<br><br><\/strong><ul><li>Bachelor\u00e2\u0080\u0099s degree in human resource management, business administration, or related field from an accredited college or university or the international equivalent required.<\/li><li>Minimum two (2) years\u00e2\u0080\u0099 experience in working for a global\/international or reputable local organization in the same capacity.<\/li><li>Working knowledge of computers, internet access, and the ability to navigate within an automated HRIS system as well as variety software packages such as Excel, Word, and PowerPoint; familiar with social media and relevant company\/brand efforts.<\/li><li>Good working knowledge in recruitment strategies and talent pool management<\/li><li>Knowledge of accepted human resources practices and the laws governing employment and fair treatment of employees globally.<\/li><li>Must be tactful, resolute, and committed to providing excellent customer service.<\/li><li>Must have a flexible approach to change, is able to work effectively in a variety of situations, seeks improvements and looks to the future.<\/li><li>Strong written and presentational skills; ability to clearly communicate complex messages to a variety of audiences including management.<\/li><li>Ability to work with colleagues, managers, and stakeholders in effective partnership.<br><br><\/li><\/ul><strong>We know there's a lot to consider.<\/strong> As you go through the application process, our recruiters will be glad to provide guidance, and more relevant details to answer any additional questions. Thank you again for your interest in Royal Caribbean Group. We'll hope to see you onboard soon!<br><br>It is the policy of the Company to ensure equal employment and promotion opportunity to qualified candidates without discrimination or harassment on the basis of race, color, religion, sex, age, national origin, disability, sexual orientation, sexuality, gender identity or expression, marital status, or any other characteristic protected by law. Royal Caribbean Group and each of its subsidiaries prohibit and will not tolerate discrimination or harassment.<br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **HARMLESS** and tag RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ== when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ==). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Nassau, ","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-sourcer-private-destinations-royal-caribbean-group-1137172","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-sourcer-private-destinations-royal-caribbean-group-1137172"},{"slug":"remote-principal-engineer-the-ai-whistleblower-initiative-1137162","id":"1137162","epoch":1787821202,"date":"2026-08-27T09:00:02+00:00","company":"The AI Whistleblower Initiative","company_logo":"","position":"Principal Engineer","tags":["golang","engineer"],"description":"Remote - About AIWIAIWI is an independent non-profit that exists to ensure that insiders at frontier AI companies can speak up safely and effectively when they see something that should be addressed. We do this by integrating the ecosystem of lawyers, AI researchers, AI advoc...<br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **EARNESTNESS** and tag RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ== when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ==). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-principal-engineer-the-ai-whistleblower-initiative-1137162","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-principal-engineer-the-ai-whistleblower-initiative-1137162"},{"slug":"remote-now-hiring-greater-pell-city-chamber-of-commerce-1137165","id":"1137165","epoch":1787814022,"date":"2026-08-27T07:00:22+00:00","company":"Greater Pell City Chamber of Commerce","company_logo":"","position":"Now Hiring","tags":["marketing","non tech"],"description":"New South Express is seeking dedicated, hardworking individuals to join our team. We offer exciting career opportunities in transportation and logistics, competitive pay, comprehensive benefits, and opportunities for professional growth. If you are committed to safety, teamwork, and delivering exceptional service, we invite you to apply and become part of a company that keeps businesses moving and customers satisfied.<br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **SMARTEST** and tag RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ== when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ==). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Lincoln, ","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-now-hiring-greater-pell-city-chamber-of-commerce-1137165","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-now-hiring-greater-pell-city-chamber-of-commerce-1137165"},{"slug":"remote-gardener-nusc-w-hotels-1137185","id":"1137185","epoch":1787800792,"date":"2026-08-27T03:19:52+00:00","company":"W Hotels","company_logo":"","position":"Gardener NUSC","tags":["education","customer support","finance","non tech","supervisor","c","exec"],"description":"<strong>Additional Information<br><br><\/strong><strong>Job Number<\/strong> 26108538<br><br><strong>Job Category<\/strong> Landscaping &amp; Grounds<br><br><strong>Location<\/strong> Estrada da Gale, Sesmarias, Albufeira, Portugal, Portugal, 8200-385VIEW ON MAP<br><br><strong>Schedule<\/strong> Full Time<br><br><strong>Located Remotely?<\/strong> N<br><br><strong>Position Type<\/strong>  Non-Management<br><br>Supervisar los terrenos del hotel a fin de asegurar una apariencia agradable. Mantener el aspecto de las fuentes, las macetas u otros detalles del terreno a trav\u00c3\u00a9s de la limpieza, sustituci\u00c3\u00b3n o reparaci\u00c3\u00b3n. Sembrar flores, bulbos, c\u00c3\u00a9sped, \u00c3\u00a1rboles y arbustos nuevos. Mantener los canteros, cestas y cajas mediante el riego, retiro de maleza, poda y otras tareas de mantenimiento. Reemplazar y transplantar \u00c3\u00a1rboles, flores y arbustos. Mantener los \u00c3\u00a1rboles y arbustos mediante la poda. Recortar los bordes del c\u00c3\u00a9sped en \u00c3\u00a1reas donde no llega la cortadora de c\u00c3\u00a9sped. Cortar y recortar los bordes del c\u00c3\u00a9sped, rastrillar las hojas y realizar otras tareas de mantenimiento del c\u00c3\u00a9sped. Instalar, mantener y operar los sistemas de irrigaci\u00c3\u00b3n. Retirar y embolsar la basura de todos los botes de basura exteriores. Manejar camiones de volteo, tractores, camiones o veh\u00c3\u00adculos utilitarios para transportar equipos, provisiones, materiales y desechos. Lavar, limpiar y reabastecer de combustible todos los equipos despu\u00c3\u00a9s de usarlos.<br><br>Cumplir con todas las pol\u00c3\u00adticas y procedimientos de seguridad de la compa\u00c3\u00b1\u00c3\u00ada; informar cualquier problema de mantenimiento, peligros para la seguridad, accidentes o lesiones; completar la capacitaci\u00c3\u00b3n y certificaciones sobre seguridad. Asegurarse de que tanto el uniforme como la apariencia personal sean pulcros y profesionales. Mantener la privacidad de la informaci\u00c3\u00b3n propiedad de la compa\u00c3\u00b1\u00c3\u00ada; proteger sus bienes. Apoyar a todos los compa\u00c3\u00b1eros de trabajo y tratarlos con dignidad y respeto. Dar apoyo al equipo para alcanzar metas comunes. Cumplir las expectativas y los est\u00c3\u00a1ndares de aseguramiento de la calidad. Mover, levantar, transportar, empujar, arrastrar y colocar objetos con un peso inferior a 50 libras (22,50 Kg) o su equivalente sin asistencia. Estar de pie, sentarse o caminar durante per\u00c3\u00adodos prolongados o durante el turno de trabajo completo. Inspeccionar visualmente herramientas, equipos o m\u00c3\u00a1quinas (por ejemplo, para identificar defectos). Agarrar, dar vuelta y manipular objetos de varios tama\u00c3\u00b1os y pesos, lo que requiere habilidades motrices finas y buena coordinaci\u00c3\u00b3n entre las manos y los ojos. Alcanzar por encima de la cabeza y debajo de la rodillas, incluso agacharse, girar la cintura, arrastrar e inclinarse. Moverse por superficies inclinadas, desniveladas o resbalosas y escalinatas. Subir y bajar escaleras de mano. Hacer uso continuo de destreza manual y habilidades motoras empleando con frecuencia ambas manos y funciones motrices finas. Ocuparse de la remoci\u00c3\u00b3n de nieve y mantenimiento de hielo (si corresponde). Efectuar otras tareas de trabajo razonables solicitadas por sus supervisores.<br><br>APTITUDES DESEABLES<br><br>Educaci\u00c3\u00b3n:T\u00c3\u00adtulo de estudios secundarios o certificado equivalente de un programa de Desarrollo de Educaci\u00c3\u00b3n General<br><br>(General Educational Development, GED).<br><br>Experiencia laboral af\u00c3\u00adn:Al menos 1 a\u00c3\u00b1o de experiencia laboral af\u00c3\u00adn.<br><br>Experiencia como supervisor:No se requiere experiencia como supervisor.<br><br>APTITUDES OBLIGATORIAS<br><br>Licencia o certificaci\u00c3\u00b3n:Carnet de conducir v\u00c3\u00a1lido<br><br><em>En Marriott International, nos comprometemos a ofrecer igualdad de oportunidades, a hacer que todos se sientan bienvenidos y a facilitar el acceso a oportunidades laborales. Promovemos activamente un entorno en el que se valora y celebra la diversidad de or\u00c3\u00adgenes de nuestros asociados. Nuestra gran fortaleza yace en la exquisita fusi\u00c3\u00b3n de culturas, talentos y experiencias de nuestros asociados. Nos comprometemos a no discriminar por motivos de discapacidad, condici\u00c3\u00b3n de veterano u otras caracter\u00c3\u00adsticas protegidas por la legislaci\u00c3\u00b3n vigente.<br><br><\/em>La misi\u00c3\u00b3n de W Hotels es despertar la curiosidad y expandir mundos. Somos un lugar para disfrutar de la vida. Estamos aqu\u00c3\u00ad para abrir puertas y mentes. Constantemente nos dejamos inspirar por nuevas caras y nuevas experiencias. Nuestro n\u00c3\u00bacleo es un esp\u00c3\u00adritu armonioso y listo para todo, que nos ha hecho famosos por reinventar las normas del lujo en todo el mundo. El servicio Whatever\/Whenever es nuestra cultura y la filosof\u00c3\u00ada de servicio que hace realidad las pasiones de los hu\u00c3\u00a9spedes. Si eres original, innovador y siempre miras hacia las posibilidades que te brinda el futuro, te damos la bienvenida a W Hotels. Al unirte a W Hotels, te unes a una cartera de marcas con Marriott International. <strong>Estar\u00c3\u00a1s<\/strong>  donde puedes llevar a cabo tu mejor trabajo, <strong>comenzar\u00c3\u00a1s<\/strong>  a cumplir tu prop\u00c3\u00b3sito, <strong>formar\u00c3\u00a1s parte<\/strong>  de un incre\u00c3\u00adble equipo mundial y <strong>te convertir\u00c3\u00a1s<\/strong>  en tu mejor versi\u00c3\u00b3n.<br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **ENTHRALLED** and tag RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ== when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ==). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Albufeira, ","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-gardener-nusc-w-hotels-1137185","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-gardener-nusc-w-hotels-1137185"},{"slug":"remote-gardener-w-hotels-1137164","id":"1137164","epoch":1787800776,"date":"2026-08-27T03:19:36+00:00","company":"W Hotels","company_logo":"","position":"Gardener","tags":["design","education","marketing","travel","scheme","ops","medical","engineer","digital nomad","infosec","customer support","exec"],"description":"<strong>Additional Information<br><br><\/strong><strong>Job Number<\/strong> 26108538<br><br><strong>Job Category<\/strong> Landscaping &amp; Grounds<br><br><strong>Location<\/strong> Estrada da Gale, Sesmarias, Albufeira, Portugal, Portugal, 8200-385VIEW ON MAP<br><br><strong>Schedule<\/strong> Full Time<br><br><strong>Located Remotely?<\/strong> N<br><br><strong>Position Type<\/strong>  Non-Management<br><br><strong>Position Summary<br><br><\/strong>Monitor property grounds to ensure a pleasant appearance. Maintain the appearance of fountains, planters, or other grounds features by cleaning, replacing or making repairs. Install new flowers, bulbs, grass, trees, and shrubs. Maintain flower beds, baskets, and boxes by watering, removing weeds, trimming, and performing other maintenance. Replace and transplant trees, flowers, and shrubs. Maintain trees and shrubs by trimming and pruning. Trim and edge grass in areas that mowers cannot reach. Maintain lawns by mowing, edging, raking leaves, and performing other lawn maintenance. Install, maintain, and operate irrigation systems. Remove and bag trash from all exterior trash cans. Operate dump trucks, tractors, trucks, or utility vehicles to transport equipment, supplies, materials, and debris. Wash, clean, and re-fuel all equipment after use.<br><br>Follow all company and safety and security policies and procedures; report defective equipment, accidents, injuries, and unsafe work conditions to manager; complete safety training and certifications. Ensure uniform and personal appearance are clean and professional; protect company assets. Support team to reach common goals. Ensure adherence to quality expectations and standards. Visually inspect tools, equipment, or machines (e.g., to identify defects). Stand, sit, or walk for an extended period of time or for an entire work shift. Move, lift, carry, push, pull, and place objects weighing less than or equal to 50 pounds without assistance. Grasp, turn, and manipulate objects of varying size and weight, requiring fine motor skills and hand-eye coordination. Move over sloping, uneven, or slippery surfaces as well as up and down ladders. Reach overhead and below the knees, including bending, twisting, pulling, and stooping. Removal of snow and maintenance of ice management (if applicable). Continual use of manual dexterity and gross motor skills with frequent use of bi-manual dexterity and fine motor skills. Perform other reasonable job duties as requested by Supervisors.<br><br><strong>Preferred Qualifications<br><br><\/strong>Education: High school diploma or G.E.D. equivalent.<br><br>Related Work Experience: At least 1 year of related work experience.<br><br>Supervisory Experience: No supervisory experience.<br><br><strong>Required Qualifications<br><br><\/strong>License or Certification: Valid Driver\u00e2\u0080\u0099s License<br><br><em>At Marriott International, we are dedicated to being an equal opportunity employer, welcoming all and providing access to opportunity. We actively foster an environment where the unique backgrounds of our associates are valued and celebrated.\u00e2\u0080\u00afOur greatest strength lies in the rich blend of culture, talent, and experiences of our associates. We are committed to non-discrimination on any protected basis, including disability, veteran status, or other basis protected by applicable law.<br><br><\/em>W Hotels\u00e2\u0080\u0099 mission is to Ignite Curiosity, Expand Worlds. We are a place to experience life. We\u00e2\u0080\u0099re here to open doors and open minds. We are constantly inspired by new faces and new experiences. A tuned-in, up-for-anything spirit is at our core and has made us renowned for reinventing the norms of luxury around the globe. Whatever\/Whenever is our culture and service philosophy that brings our guests\u00e2\u0080\u0099 passions to life. If you are original, innovative, and always looking towards the future of what\u00e2\u0080\u0099s possible, welcome to W Hotels. In joining W Hotels, you join a portfolio of brands with Marriott International. <strong>Be<\/strong>  where you can do your best work, <strong>begin<\/strong>  your purpose, <strong>belong<\/strong>  to an amazing global team, and <strong>become<\/strong>  the best version of you.<br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **BRAINIEST** and tag RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ== when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ==). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Albufeira, ","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-gardener-w-hotels-1137164","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-gardener-w-hotels-1137164"},{"slug":"remote-assistant-manager-storage-king-group-1137161","id":"1137161","epoch":1787797629,"date":"2026-08-27T02:27:09+00:00","company":"Storage King Group","company_logo":"","position":"Assistant Manager","tags":["exec","virtual assistant","education","customer support","marketing","travel","finance","legal","sales","medical","recruiter","full time"],"description":"<strong>About Us<br><br><\/strong>Storage King is a fast-growing business offering stable and rewarding employment. We have a fun and friendly culture across our store network which currently includes over 200 stores across Australia and New Zealand. Storage King is a market leader in self-storage and with continued growth plans it is an exciting time to become involved with our brand.<br><br><strong>Certified Great Place to Work \u00e2\u0080\u0093 2025\/2026 in both Australia and New Zealand<br><br><\/strong><strong>The Role<br><br><\/strong>We currently have a <strong>full-time<\/strong> position available for an Assistant Store Manager to join our teams based in Rozelle &amp; Balmain. Assistant Store Managers are the key support management role in store and work hand in hand with the leadership to deliver exceptional store results and customer service.<br><br><strong>Working Hours<br><br><\/strong>Tuesday to Saturday<br><br>Total 38 hours per week<br><br>Occasional Sunday shifts may be offered.<br><br><strong>We Are Open<br><br><\/strong>Monday to Friday 8am - 5pm<br><br>Saturday 8am - 4pm<br><br>Sunday 10am - 4pm<br><br>Some flexibility will be required for this role.<br><br><strong>About You<br><br><\/strong>To be successful in this role, you will bring:<br><br><ul><li>Ideal if you have a retail, sales or hospitality background<\/li><li>Willingness to learn new skills associated with a sales and customer service role - training is provided<\/li><li>Self-motivated and able to work using own initiative or with support and direction<\/li><li>Enjoy problem solving and taking ownership of tasks<\/li><li>Passion for delivering customer service excellence, with an above and beyond attitude and work ethic<\/li><li>Enthusiasm as a team player with a hands on approach to a diverse range of tasks<\/li><li>Goal orientated and results driven<\/li><li>Written and verbal communication skills<\/li><li>Physically fit<\/li><li>Drivers License<br><br><\/li><\/ul><strong>In return we offer:<br><br><\/strong><ul><li>Competitive hourly rate + monthly and quarterly performance bonuses<\/li><li>Full training and career progression opportunities<\/li><li>A flexible working environment and strong team culture<\/li><li>No late nights or public holidays<\/li><li>Uniform and laundry allowance<\/li><li>On-site parking provided<\/li><li>Discounted health insurance through Medibank<\/li><li>Assure Wellbeing Program \u00e2\u0080\u0093 access to a wide range of free, confidential support services for you and your immediate family. This includes professional counselling, nutrition and lifestyle coaching, financial and legal advice, and wellbeing tools to help you thrive both at work and in life.<\/li><li>Paid Parental Leave \u00e2\u0080\u0093 generous paid leave for primary carers (16 weeks) and partners (4 weeks) after 12 months of service, supporting you during one of life\u00e2\u0080\u0099s most important milestones<\/li><li>Access to exclusive retail discounts on fashion, groceries, travel, and more via our employee platform<br><br><\/li><\/ul>Want to learn more about working with us? Visit our careers site to hear from our team, watch employee videos and see what makes Storage King a great place to grow your career. https:\/\/storagekingcareers.com.au\/<br><br>Self-Storage is a growing industry with opportunities for those who are passionate about creating great customer experiences. If you want to work as part of a close team to find solutions for our customers storage requirements and enjoy contributing to the end to end running of a store, you\u00e2\u0080\u0099d be a great fit for our team!<br><br>If this sounds like the opportunity you've been looking for, we\u00e2\u0080\u0099d love to hear from you \u00e2\u0080\u0093 <strong>apply today<\/strong>!<br><br><em>We value the important work recruitment agencies do, but all our hiring is managed exclusively by our internal recruitment team. We kindly ask agencies not to contact us regarding these opportunities. Thank you for your understanding.<\/em><br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **DESERVEDLY** and tag RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ== when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ==). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Rozelle, ","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-assistant-manager-storage-king-group-1137161","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-assistant-manager-storage-king-group-1137161"},{"slug":"remote-senior-level-designer-blackbird-interactive-1137156","id":"1137156","epoch":1787788823,"date":"2026-08-27T00:00:23+00:00","company":"Blackbird Interactive","company_logo":"","position":"Senior Level Designer","tags":["design","game dev","designer","technical","customer support","testing","content writing","senior","engineer","digital nomad"],"description":"<p>Blackbird Interactive is a creative-fueled, future-driven, independent game studio where the best talent in the industry can find long-term careers to help grow their abilities while working on a wide range of projects, which encompass world-class IPs as well as our own creations across multiple genres.<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p>Our studio operates as a remote-first workplace, offering flexible work arrangements.<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p><strong>PLEASE NOTE: At this time, we are only able to hire candidates who are legally eligible to work in Canada and reside within Canada.<\/strong><\/p><p><br><\/p><p>\n<\/p><p>Blackbird Interactive is looking for an experienced <strong>Senior Level Designer<\/strong> to help build and deliver high-quality gameplay spaces for an action RPG focused on fast-paced combat, character progression, exploration, and replayability. This role focuses on designing levels, encounters, and environments that create satisfying combat opportunities, reward exploration, and support a wide variety of player builds and abilities.<\/p>\n<p>You'll work closely with systems design, combat design, art, narrative, audio, and engineering to create spaces that complement the game's core combat systems while providing strong pacing, readability, and a sense of discovery. The role involves collaborating with leadership to align content with the overall creative vision while owning levels end-to-end, from initial layout and blockout through implementation, iteration, and polish. As a senior designer, you'll be expected to independently solve complex level design problems, provide strong design judgment, and help establish a high quality bar for playable content across the game.<\/p>\n<p><\/p>\\n<p><\/p><p><br><\/p><b>Responsibilities<\/b><div>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Collaborate with combat, systems, narrative, art, engineering, audio, and production to create levels that support the established creative vision and core gameplay pillars<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p>Own levels end-to-end, including layouts, blockouts, combat spaces, encounters, traversal, exploration, pacing, and player flow<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p>Design engaging combat spaces that support varied enemies, character builds, abilities, positioning, and different approaches to combat<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p>Create rewarding exploration through optional paths, secrets, environmental storytelling, and meaningful rewards while maintaining clear navigation and progression<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p>Script and implement gameplay events, encounters, objectives, triggers, and environmental interactions directly in engine<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p>Test, debug, and iterate on levels using playtest feedback to improve combat flow, difficulty, pacing, readability, and replayability<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div><p><br><\/p><b>Requirements<\/b><div>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>A minimum of 8 years of game development experience, with significant experience designing and implementing levels for action, RPG, or combat focused games<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p>Experience shipping multiple titles, including at least one in a senior or equivalent level design role<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p>Proven ability to independently own complex levels from initial concept and blockout through implementation, iteration, and final polish<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p>Strong understanding of action RPG level design, including combat spaces, encounter pacing, exploration, progression, player guidance, and replayability<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p>Strong hands-on experience with level editing, gameplay scripting, and in-engine implementation, with the ability to prototype, debug, and iterate quickly<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p>Strong design judgment, communication, and collaboration skills, with the ability to balance gameplay quality, creative goals, technical constraints, and production realities<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div><p><br><\/p><b>Pluses<\/b><div>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Passion for action RPGs centered on combat, character builds, loot, progression, and exploration<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p>Experience designing levels for an isometric or elevated gameplay camera, with an understanding of its impact on combat readability, navigation, and composition<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p>Experience creating replayable content that supports different character builds, abilities, difficulty levels, or repeated playthroughs<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p>Appreciation for systemic combat and how level geometry, enemy composition, hazards, and interactive elements combine to create varied encounters<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p>Experience designing dungeons, interconnected environments, procedural or modular level content, or other repeatable gameplay spaces<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p>Strong instincts for environmental storytelling, gameplay readability, polish, and identifying opportunities to improve the player experience through iteration<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div><p><br><\/p><p><\/p>\\n<div>$115,000 - $149,500 a year<\/div>\\n<br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **PERSONAGES** and tag RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ== when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ==). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Vancouver, BC, Canada","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-senior-level-designer-blackbird-interactive-1137156","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-senior-level-designer-blackbird-interactive-1137156"},{"slug":"remote-oracle-fusion-cloud-lead-logistics-supply-chain-management-tessera-labs-1137155","id":"1137155","epoch":1787788817,"date":"2026-08-27T00:00:17+00:00","company":"Tessera Labs","company_logo":"","position":"Oracle Fusion Cloud Lead \u00e2\u0080\u0094 Logistics & Supply Chain Management","tags":["design","sys admin","consulting","testing","exec","cloud","senior","ops","engineer","ecommerce","shopify","full time","digital nomad"],"description":"<p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Oracle Fusion Cloud Lead \u00e2\u0080\u0094 Logistics &amp; Supply Chain Management<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Greenfield Oracle Fusion Implementation<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Company <strong>Tessera Labs AI<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Role Type Senior consulting engagement \u00e2\u0080\u0094 full-time or contract, workstream-critical role<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Location Nearshore, based in Mexico or Brazil \u00e2\u0080\u0094 remote-based delivery model; excellent business<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>English required for direct engagement with client stakeholders and leadership<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Reports To Program Director \/ Engagement Lead, Tessera Labs AI<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>About the Role<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Tessera Labs AI is a technology product firm delivering next-generation, AI-accelerated enterprise transformation programs. We are seeking an experienced Oracle Fusion Cloud Lead to own the Logistics and Supply Chain Management (SCM) workstream for a greenfield Oracle Fusion Cloud implementation for a fast-growing client.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">This is a greenfield implementation from a process and configuration standpoint \u00e2\u0080\u0094 there is no legacy SCM configuration to reverse-engineer or carry forward, and the opportunity is to stand up Oracle Fusion Cloud Inventory Management, Order Management, Indirect Procurement and related logistics processes from a blank slate, configured to Oracle standard wherever possible. Data is a different story: item, article, inventory, and other master and historical data still needs to be extracted, transformed, and loaded (ETL) from the client&amp;#39;s legacy ERP into Oracle Fusion, and this role supports that migration effort alongside the functional design work.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">This is a highly cross-functional, business-facing role. You will run discovery and design workshops directly with logistics, supply chain, and procurement stakeholders \u00e2\u0080\u0094 including ownership of the Indirect Procurement value stream \u00e2\u0080\u0094 translate their requirements into working Oracle Fusion design and configuration, and own the documentation trail from business requirement through configuration and test. You will also own the integration design connecting Oracle Fusion to Shopify for e-commerce order and inventory synchronization, and to the client'swarehouse management system(s) for outbound and inbound logistics \u00e2\u0080\u0094 alongside integration with adjacent Oracle Fusion modules as applicable.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">This is a nearshore delivery role, based in Mexico or Brazil, working in a remote-first model alongside Tessera's distributed FDE delivery and AI engineering teams. Because you will be running workshops and presenting directly tobusiness stakeholders and client leadership, excellent business English \u00e2\u0080\u0094 spoken and written \u00e2\u0080\u0094 is essential to this role.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><strong>Key Responsibilities<\/strong><\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">\u00e2\u0080\u00a2 Lead and facilitate business process workshops with logistics, supply chain, procurement, and operations stakeholders to capture requirements for a greenfield Oracle Fusion Cloud implementation, spanning Inventory Management, Order Management, Indirect Procurement, and related logistics processes.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">\u00e2\u0080\u00a2 Own end-to-end functional configuration of Oracle Fusion modules \u00e2\u0080\u0094 Inventory Management, Order<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Management, and Procurement, with particular ownership of the Indirect Procurement value stream,<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">translating workshop outcomes into a working, standard-first system design.<\/p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">\u00e2\u0080\u00a2 Configure and maintain the Oracle article\/item master setup in line with fashion and apparel industry best practices (e.g., style, color, and size hierarchies, seasonal and pre-pack\/kit structures) and Oracle Retail conventions.<\/p><br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **GOODNESS** and tag RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ== when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ==). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"","salary_min":30,"salary_max":36,"apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-oracle-fusion-cloud-lead-logistics-supply-chain-management-tessera-labs-1137155","logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-oracle-fusion-cloud-lead-logistics-supply-chain-management-tessera-labs-1137155"},{"slug":"remote-ajudante-geral-supermercados-mundial-1137252","id":"1137252","epoch":1787788800,"date":"2026-08-27T00:00:00+00:00","company":"Supermercados Mundial","company_logo":"","position":"Ajudante Geral","tags":[],"description":"O Supermercados Mundial est\u00c3\u00a1 contratando para diversas fun\u00c3\u00a7\u00c3\u00b5es em suas unidades do Rio de Janeiro e Niter\u00c3\u00b3i. As vagas oferecem remunera\u00c3\u00a7\u00c3\u00a3o a partir de R$ 1.810,00, incluindo vale-transporte, alimenta\u00c3\u00a7\u00c3\u00a3o no local, seguro de vida, plano funeral, pr\u00c3\u00aamio assiduidade, planos cl\u00c3\u00adnico e odontol\u00c3\u00b3gico e conv\u00c3\u00aanio com faculdades.<br><br>Ensino fundamental completo (para o cargo de Locutor \u00c3\u00a9 necess\u00c3\u00a1ria experi\u00c3\u00aancia na \u00c3\u00a1rea).<br><br>Vale-Transporte (vt), alimenta\u00c3\u00a7\u00c3\u00a3o no local, seguro de vida, plano funeral, pr\u00c3\u00aamio assiduidade, planos cl\u00c3\u00adnico e odontol\u00c3\u00b3gico e conv\u00c3\u00aanio com faculdades.<br\/><br\/>Please mention the word **RECOVER** and tag RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ== when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RNzAuMTIyLjE3LjI0NQ==). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.","location":"Rio de Janeiro e Regi\u00c3\u00a3o, ","apply_url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-ajudante-geral-supermercados-mundial-1137252","salary_min":0,"salary_max":0,"logo":"","url":"https:\/\/remoteOK.com\/remote-jobs\/remote-ajudante-geral-supermercados-mundial-1137252"}]